      "name": "NYC: July 4 Fireworks Cruise with Light Buffet Dinner & DJ",
      "description": "<div><p>Celebrate Independence Day New York style on a 2-story boat with an outdoor deck area. Admire views of Manhattan’s skyline and landmarks being lit up by Macy’s annual 4th of July fireworks. Enjoy a buffet dinner with passed hors d'oeuvres, a live DJ dancing and a cash bar.The cruise departs from Pier 36 and passes under the Manhattan and Brooklyn bridges. On your right, enjoy views of City Hall, the Woolworth Building, South Street Seaport, the Manhattan Skyline, and Wall Street. On your left, the districts of DUMBO and Brooklyn Heights.Pass by Governors Island at the southern tip of Manhattan with panoramic views of Lower Manhattan. Admire the Freedom Tower, the tallest building in the Western Hemisphere, as well as views up the Hudson River to Hudson Yards.After passing Ellis Island, Liberty Island and the Statue of Liberty come into view. Take photos from the boat with this Iconic symbol of America before it makes its way to the best viewing point for the fireworks.During the cruise, and before the fireworks (which usually start around 9 PM), you can enjoy appetizers and food from the buffet stations along with unlimited coffee, tea, and water and drinks from a full cash bar. Dance on the outdoor deck with music played by a live DJ.Enjoy front-row seats for the Macy’s fireworks display, the largest fireworks show in the United States. Once the fireworks display is over, the boat will make its way back to the meeting point.Menu (may be subject to change):• Assorted appetizers• Vegetarian Pasta station• Choice of Beef, Fish and Chicken dishes• Mixed green salad• 4th of July inspired dessert station</p></div>",
