      "name": "Statue of Liberty Cruise & Choice of 911 Museum OR Statue of Liberty Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Have your cameras ready! Experience up close view of the Statue of Liberty on your sightseeing cruise. Guests can choose from VIP entry to the 911 Memorial Museum or take Statue of Liberty Pre-ferry tour with reserve access to Liberty &amp; Ellis Island.\n\nAs a monument to human dignity, courage, and sacrifice, the 9/11 Memorial &amp; Museum honors the nearly 3,000 people killed in the terrorist attacks of September 11, 2001 and February 26, 1993, recognizes the courage of those who survived, and salutes those who risked their lives to help others.\n\nWith the Statue of Liberty Pre-ferry tour, guests will be guided on tour through Battery Park before VIP reserve boarding on ferry to take them to Liberty Island and Ellis Island where they can explore all of the history at their leisure.</p></div>",
