      "name": "Statue of Liberty Guided tour & One Day Double Decker Hop On Hop Off City Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Looking for an unforgettable way to experience the best of New York City? Look no further than our exclusive tour, which combines a guided tour of Battery Park with guaranteed access to the Statue of Liberty and Ellis Island, followed by a hop on hop off bus tour of the city's most famous landmarks.We'll start our adventure with a 30-minute guided tour of Battery Park, where our knowledgeable guide will show you around the park and provide fascinating insights and stories about its history and culture. You'll learn about the many famous landmarks in the area, such as the Sphere sculpture, the SeaGlass Carousel, and the historic Castle Clinton. You'll also learn about the park's role in New York's history and culture, and discover why it's one of the city's most beloved destinations.From there, we'll head to the Statue of Liberty and Ellis Island, where you'll enjoy guaranteed access to these iconic landmarks. You can choose to explore on your own with audio guides, or upgrade to a fully-escorted tour of Liberty Island and Ellis Island, where you'll learn about the history and significance of these famous sites. Our expert guides will share fascinating insights and stories about the statue and the island, making your experience truly unforgettable.After visiting the Statue of Liberty and Ellis Island, it's time to explore the city at your own pace with our hop on hop off Double Decker sightseeing bus tour. You can hop on and off at famous locations like Rockefeller Center, Empire State Building, Times Square, and much more. Our fun and friendly tour guides will provide fascinating insights and stories about the city's rich history and culture, making your experience unique and unforgettable.Along the way, you'll learn about the city's vibrant neighborhoods, famous landmarks, and rich cultural heritage, gaining a deeper appreciation for this iconic city. You'll also have plenty of opportunities to take photos and make memories that will last a lifetime.So come join us for an exclusive tour of Battery Park, the Statue of Liberty, and Ellis Island, followed by a hop on hop off bus tour of the city's most famous landmarks. Our expert guides and fun-filled itinerary will leave you with memories that will last a lifetime. Whether you're a seasoned traveler or a first-time visitor, this tour promises to be an unforgettable way to experience the best of New York City.</p></div>",
