      "name": "Statue of Liberty, Ellis Island, and Brooklyn Bridge After Hour Cruise",
      "description": "<div><p>The Sunset Cruise is the perfect after-work spot for locals and tourists in New York City to unwind and enjoy some great music, delicious food, and stunning views.As you set sail on the Hudson River, you'll be treated to an onboard DJ spinning tunes that will get you moving and grooving. The music, combined with the breathtaking views of New York City's skyline, makes for an unforgettable experience.During the cruise, you'll see some of the city's most iconic landmarks, including the Statue of Liberty, Ellis Island, and the Brooklyn Bridge. These landmarks take on a whole new dimension when viewed from the water, and you'll be able to capture some amazing photos to remember the experience.In addition to the music and views, the Sunset Cruise also offers a great selection of food and drinks to enjoy. Whether you're looking for a light bite or a full meal, there's something for everyone on board. The Sunset Cruise is a must-do experience for anyone looking to unwind after a long day in the city or to enjoy a romantic evening with a loved one. With great music, delicious food, and stunning views, it's no wonder that the Sunset Cruise is quickly becoming a favorite spot for both locals and tourists alike.</p></div>",
