      "name": "Statue of Liberty and Ellis Island Ferry Ticket with Upgrade Options",
      "description": "<div><p>HighlightsSave time by prebooking ferry tickets to Liberty Island &amp; Ellis IslandPick a ticket option to suit your budget and travel styleChoose a departure time that fits in with your scheduleUpgrade to include a live guide for a smoother more personal experienceExtend your visit to include 9/11 Memorial, Wall Street &amp; Ground ZeroEnjoy a ferry ride to the Statue of Liberty and Ellis Island and Explore America’s most iconic landmarks. Choose between 4 options:- Statue Standard Ticket: Enjoy a standard timed ferry ticket to Liberty Island and Ellis Island- Statue Reserve Ticket Pre-ferry: Upgrade to include a pre-ferry orientation tour at Battery Park. Understand how to use the multilingual audio tours at both the Statue of Liberty and Ellis Island and enjoy priority boarding for the ferry.- Statue of Liberty &amp; Ellis Island Guided Tour: Upgrade further to include an expert local guide who will escort you on the ferry and guide your around both Liberty Island and Ellis Island- Statue of Liberty, Ellis Island &amp; 9/11 Memorial Guided Tour: Experience the most complete tour where the guide will also tour you around the 9/11 Memorial, Ground Zero and Wall St.</p></div>",
