      "name": "NYC Cupcake Bakery Crawl of the Village",
      "description": "<div><p>What is a Cupcake? Learn as we visit some of the best small bakeshops in NYC that New Yorker look for. We will take you to hidden secret bakeries starting in the West Village &amp; continuing to the East Village as we search, during Bakery crawl for the best the city has. From the mini classic butter cream cupcake to Red Velvet cream cheese cupcake to the local bakeries with new flavor released daily. Let's go and find your favorite Cupcake.\nThis Bakery Crawl will take 90 minutes &amp; we will walk about 1.5 miles &amp; visit the local bakeries plus taste some of the most desired cupcakes New Yorkers Rave about. Let's not forget the art &amp; music we will experience as we crawl to the next bakery through the famous Washington Square Park &amp; the street's of the Village.\nOur guest will leave with a a newly discovered love for New York's Bakeries &amp; the Village. We will have opportunities to look and shop at the bakeries to take home so goodies. Please remember to bring a bottle of water with you.</p></div>",
