      "name": "NYC Holiday Double-Decker Bus and Walking Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Explore the festive side of New York City at the holidays on this 1.5-hour, Christmas walking tour. See Rockefeller Center, decked out with its sparkling lights, busy ice-skating rink, and famous Christmas tree. See the brilliant window displays at Saks Fifth Ave and Lord and Taylor. Then end the tour with a Double Decker Holiday Lights Night tour. Enjoy a 60 min holiday cruise with Santa during your stay. </p></div>",
