      "name": "Statue of Liberty and Ellis Island Tour in Spanish",
      "description": "<div><p>HighlightsSave time by prebooking ferry tickets to Liberty Island &amp; Ellis IslandPick a ticket option to suit your budget and travel styleTour the Statue Liberty &amp; Ellis Island with a Spanish-language audio guideUpgrade to include a live Spanish-speaking guide for a more personal experienceExtend your visit to include 9/11 Memorial, Wall Street &amp; Ground ZeroEnjoy a ferry ride to the Statue of Liberty and Ellis Island and Explore America’s most iconic landmarks. Choose between 4 options:- Statue Standard Ticket: Enjoy a standard timed ferry ticket to Liberty Island and Ellis Island- Express Self-Guided Tour in French with Pre-ferry Tour: Upgrade to include a pre-ferry orientation tour in Spanish at Battery Park. Understand how to use the Spanish language audio tours at both the Statue of Liberty and Ellis Island and enjoy priority boarding for the ferry.- Statue of Liberty &amp; Ellis Island Guided Tour in Spanish: Upgrade further to include an expert Spanish -speaking local guide who will escort you on the ferry and guide your around both Liberty Island and Ellis Island- Statue of Liberty, Ellis Island &amp; 9/11 Memorial Guided Tour in Spanish: Experience the most complete tour where the Spanish -speaking guide will also tour you around the 9/11 Memorial, Ground Zero and Wall St.</p></div>",
