      "name": "Double Decker Hop-On-Hop-Off Bus and St Patricks Cathedral",
      "description": "<div><p>Explore the vibrant city of New York with a hop-on hop-off double-decker bus tour, an experience that is both convenient and exciting. With your hop-on hop-off pass, you can easily travel to NYC's top attractions and explore them at your own pace.Board the open-top double-decker bus and immerse yourself in the sights and sounds of the city. The bus will take you to popular landmarks such as the Empire State Building, the Statue of Liberty, and Central Park, as well as other must-see locations. As you ride, take in the stunning views of the skyline and the bustling city streets.One of the stops on the tour is the iconic St. Patrick's Cathedral, a historic and awe-inspiring structure located in the heart of Manhattan. Take some time to marvel at the magnificent architecture and learn about the cathedral's rich history.After a day of sightseeing, head to Dave and Buster's in Times Square for dinner. This famous restaurant and entertainment venue offers a variety of delicious menu options and a lively atmosphere. Challenge your friends and family to a game of billiards, shuffleboard, or one of the many arcade games available.Experience the best of New York City with this double-decker hop-on hop-off bus tour and dinner at Dave and Buster's. Whether you're a first-time visitor or a seasoned traveler, this is a great way to see the city and make lasting memories.</p></div>",
