      "description": "<div><p>Experience New York City's newest observatory, The Edge at Hudson Yards, the iconic St Patrick's Cathedral and then enjoy lunch at Dave &amp; Buster's Times Square.\n\nWith your entry ticket to The Edge at Hudson Yard's, see the protruding 100-stories-high observation deck, with a glass floor, bar &amp; 360-degree NYC views.\n\nNext, experience The 160-year history of St. Patrick’s Cathedral shared by the men and women who know it best in this official audio tour. Cardinal Timothy Dolan, Monsignor Robert Ritchie and others guide you around St. Patrick's. They tell their personal stories about what makes St. Patrick’s America's favorite.\n\n</p></div>",
