      "name": "Brooklyn, Dyker Heights - Christmas Wonderland",
      "description": "<div><p>People come from all over the world just to experience the magic of New York during the holiday season. We’ll let you in on one of the best-kept secrets in NYC, where you’ll experience an enchanting Christmas wonderland full of dazzling Christmas lights and delightful displays. Come join us on the ultimate Christmas journey to Brooklyn’s Dyker Heights!The Brooklyn neighborhood of Dyker Heights is truly something special during the Christmas season. The cozy and quaint homes look like they are straight out of a storybook, decorated for the holiday season with dazzling displays, colorful characters, and thousands of twinkling lights that add Christmas cheer and a sense of jaw-dropping amazement.Dyker Heights Christmas Lights features blocks and blocks of the best Christmas decorations in Brooklyn. This cute residential neighborhood glows softly under the sparkling lights, and yes, even has festive holiday music playing for all to enjoy. During our stroll amid this whimsical Christmas wonderland, you may spot beautiful nativity displays, Santa and his reindeer, life-size inflatables, cheery snowmen, and more magical Christmas characters that adorn the charming and famed Brooklyn homes.The magical displays seem to get better and brighter every year, and we look forward to seeing all the new decorations each season! This neighborhood really goes all out at Christmas, and it is always fun to see how the homes mix it up each year.Our Brooklyn Dyker Heights Christmas Tour is ideal for all ages, including families with children, groups of friends, and couples looking for a unique date night to experience the magic of the season. The sights you’ll see on this tour are exquisite and enchanting, so be sure to bring your phone or camera to take advantage of all the amazing photo opportunities.The tour will depart midtown Manhattan from The Manhattan At Times Square, then heads out to Brooklyn, where we will hop off the vehicle and walk through the neighborhood of Dyker Heights.Dyker Heights Christmas Lights is an absolute must-see during the holiday season. You won’t believe your eyes, as you gaze in awe at the magical winter wonderland full of twinkling Christmas lights that surrounds you. Whether you are a tourist or a lifelong resident of NYC, this tour will make you feel like you are a world away from the hustle and bustle of the big city.After experiencing the festive Christmas magic of Dyker Heights, we’ll continue to another spectacular section of Brooklyn, the DUMBO neighborhood. Here, we will take a stroll under the Brooklyn Bridge, and you’ll be able to photograph the majestic skyline of Manhattan from this amazing and unique perspective. We’ll finish the tour by returning to  Manhattan At Times Square Hotel, where you can then continue on your own to enjoy more holiday festivities amid the bright lights of Times Square.We’ll make two stops during the Brooklyn Dyker Heights – Christmas Wonderland tour:Dyker Heights – Brooklyn: We’ll take a  - 1-hour walking tour of Dyker Heights to fully experience the most magical neighborhood in New York City, rich with  Christmas traditions and holiday festivitiesDUMBO: We’ll take a stroll under the Brooklyn Bridge and photograph the world-renowned skyline of Manhattan, in all of its breathtaking Christmas glory</p></div>",
