      "name": "NYC July 4th Macy's Fireworks Family Friendly Festive Boat with Bar light food",
      "description": "<div><p>The NYC July 4th Macy's Fireworks Family Friendly Festive Boat with Bar and Light Food is an exciting way to celebrate America's Independence Day with family and friends.You will board one of NYC's newly renovated boats and enjoy a festive atmosphere with a live DJ, dancing, and light food. As you cruise along the Hudson River, you will enjoy stunning views of Manhattan's skyline and pass by the Statue of Liberty and Ellis Island for excellent photo opportunities.The highlight of the evening will be Macy's Famous Fireworks, with 50,000 pounds of pyrotechnics lighting up the sky at 9:00 pm. You will have the best seat in the house to enjoy the show, with unobstructed views of the fireworks from the comfort of the boat.Throughout the evening, you can enjoy light snacks and drinks from the onboard bar, and dance the night away with family and friends.Overall, the NYC July 4th Macy's Fireworks Family Friendly Festive Boat with Bar and Light Food is a fantastic way to celebrate Independence Day in style. With live entertainment, delicious food, and a front-row seat to the fireworks, this is an experience you will never forget.</p></div>",
