      "name": "NYC Skyline and Statue of Liberty Harbor Lights Night Cruise",
      "description": "<div><p>HighlightsTake in the view as the magnificent New York Skyline lights up at nightSnap close up photos of the Statue of Liberty in the evening lightSip on the Happy Hour New Yorker cocktail or other drinks from the cash barChoose between indoor and outdoor decks and enjoy the fun music.Learn about Manhattan’s major landmarks with English and Spanish narration\nEnjoy the best views of the New York skyline on this evening happy hour cruise around lower Manhattan with onboard food options and a covered outdoor dance floor. This 2-level boat has indoor and outdoor decks to make the most of this unforgettable experience.Cruise down the East River, under the Brooklyn Bridge and take in views of Lower Manhattan. See South Street Seaport, Battery Park and unbeatable views of One World Trade Center. Then cruise up the Hudson River with views of the iconic Empire State Building and the Chrysler Building.As you sail past Ellis Island, the historic entry point for immigrants into America, the Statue of Liberty comes into view. You will get amazing views of \"Lady Liberty\" and the boat will pause here to allow you to take photos of this famous entry point to New York City in the evening light.There is light commentary throughout the cruise to help you identify the many famous buildings and neighborhoods you will see as you cruise along the Hudson River and the East River, on both sides of ManhattanEnjoy a happy hour special, beer, wine, cocktails, and soft drinks from the cash bar, If you are hungry, you can purchase snacks and food options like burgers, chicken fingers, nachos, pasta, hot dogs, cookies and hot pretzels. Enjoy the fun music as you dance and mingle on the covered outdoor deck.With a friendly crew and an incredible setting, this happy hour skyline cruise is the perfect way to unwind and experience the magic of New York City during Sunset or at Night.\n</p></div>",
