      "name": "July 4th New York City Star-Spangled Spectacle Cruise with Buffet and Live DJ",
      "description": "<div><p>Join us for a Fourth of July to remember aboard our NYC Star-Spangled Spectacle Cruise. Departing from Pier 36, this magical evening promises an open bar, light dinner, and live DJ tunes. Step aboard at 5:30 PM for a 6 PM departure, and prepare to marvel at the dazzling 8:45 PM fireworks display.Quench your thirst with a selection of alcoholic beverages available at our onboard cash bar, ensuring a spirited atmosphere throughout the night. As the awe-inspiring fireworks display commences, embrace the celebratory spirit with provided party favors, adding an extra touch of excitement to the event.This cruise offers a unique vantage point to witness the dazzling fireworks show, set against the stunning backdrop of the New York City skyline. Once the grand finale lights up the sky, the cruise will make its way back to the dock, bringing an incredible evening to a close.Don't miss out on this extraordinary opportunity to commemorate the 4th of July in style, surrounded by the unparalleled beauty of New York City and its mesmerizing fireworks spectacle. Reserve your spot on the cruise today and create lasting memories of a truly remarkable Independence Day celebration!</p></div>",
