      "name": "NYC: Holiday Cruise around the Statue of Liberty with Santa",
      "description": "<div><p>Sail within 100 feet of the Statue of Liberty and Ellis IslandEnjoy magnificent views of the New York Skyline &amp; Brooklyn BridgeTake a family photo with Santa Claus at no additional chargePurchase cookies, hot chocolate, food options and drinks onboardChoose between a 60-minute day cruise or a 90-minute night cruiseChoose between a day or evening Holiday Cruise of New York City with Santa Claus on board. Be sure to have your camera on hand as you sail within 100 feet of the Statue of Liberty, cruise under Brooklyn Bridge and view the most famous skyline in the world. A true NYC holiday experience.During this festive cruise, Santa Claus will be available for photos, free of charge. Make some great holiday memories and maybe purchase some hot chocolate and cookies. With a full cash bar on board, you can also purchase happy hour specials, beer, wine, cocktails, and soft drinks. Snacks and food options like burgers, chicken fingers, nachos, hot dogs and hot pretzels are also available.Onboard narration will point out the sites as you cruise around Manhattan. See the Empire State Building, the Freedom Tower, the Manhattan Bridge, Ellis Island, Governor's Island, South Street Seaport, and more. Use the indoor and outdoor seating and large windows for your viewing pleasure.The Day Cruise is a 60-minute cruise, while the 90-minute Night Cruise is slightly longer, going further up the Hudson River with fun music on the covered outdoor deck for you to dance and mingle. Both cruises pause near the Statue of Liberty to allow you to take photos.\n</p></div>",
