      "name": "Times Square Shake Rattle and Roll plus Dining Experience",
      "description": "<div><p>If you're looking for a high-energy Saturday night out in New York City, the Shake Rattle and Roll dueling-piano lounge is the perfect spot for you. The lounge features a dimly lit space with a lively atmosphere, where you can enjoy cocktails and dueling-piano shows.At Shake Rattle and Roll, you can even get on stage and request your favorite old-time songs, or just dance and sing along to the tunes you love. The performers are talented and engaging, making for a fun and entertaining night out.If you're looking to start your night with a meal, you can head over to the nearby Hard Rock Cafe for a delicious meal before hitting the lounge. With great food and a fun atmosphere, the Hard Rock Cafe is the perfect spot to fuel up before a night of dancing and singing along to your favorite songs.Shake Rattle and Roll is a must-visit for anyone looking for a fun and lively Saturday night out in New York City. With great music, cocktails, and an engaging atmosphere, it's the perfect spot to dance, sing, and laugh the night away.</p></div>",
