      "description": "Leave the bustling city of New York behind and explore Long Island, the playground of the rich and famous on this top day tour!\r\n\r\nPass by the famous Long Island Duck and arrive in Southampton, one of the most exclusive enclaves in America. This picturesque town is home to some of the biggest names in Hollywood! Stroll down the picturesque main street and through the historical harbor area, taking in the stunning ocean drive and looking out for celebs.\r\n\r\nNext up, it's time for a tipple at one of the oldest and most renowned wineries in Southampton. Sip some wines and learn about the art of winemaking as you soak up the breathtaking views of the vineyards.\r\n\r\nNext up is Sag Harbor, a charming and historic village on the eastern end of Long Island. Spot who's on the yachts, and browse unique shops, galleries, and restaurants before heading to lunch at a local eatery.\r\n\r\nLastly, shop till you drop at Tanger Outlets. Will you score a bargain?",
