      "name": "Hamilton: An American Musical",
      "shortDescription": "Don't miss the hottest musical in recent history!",
      "description": "Get your Hamilton tickets and see the global phenom that has taken Broadway by storm! \r\n\r\nWith virtually every accolade possible showered on the show – including a record-breaking 16 Tony Award nominations (winning 11), a Grammy, and an eventual Pulitzer Prize for the show’s writer Lin-Manuel Miranda – it’s no surprise that Hamilton has been New York’s hottest ticket since 2015.  \r\n\r\nWatch the incredible tale of Alexander Hamilton’s relentless ambition as it unfurls across the Revolutionary War and the early days of the Federal Government, until his untimely death at the hands of his contemporary, Aaron Burr. \r\n\r\nLove, scandal, camaraderie and enough historic rapping to keep any hip-hop head happy from start to finish, this is one show you can’t afford to miss.",
