      "description": "<p>Take on the world&#39;s most iconic flight (all inclusive* !): <strong>NEW YORK.&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Embark on a flight over Manhattan. Your trip to New York wouldn&#39;t be&nbsp;complete without flying over <strong>the Statue of Liberty,</strong> one of New York&#39;s top tourist spots! You&#39;ll fly over <strong>New York Harbor,</strong> the 150-year-old <strong>Brooklyn Bridge</strong>, <strong>South Street Harbor,</strong> <strong>Governors Island,</strong> and <strong>Ellis Island</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You will continue towards <strong>Hudson</strong> and enjoy incredible views of downtown Manhattan such as the<strong> Chrysler </strong>and<strong> Empire State Buildings, Chelsea Piers, Jacob Javits Convention Center, Intrepid Sea, Air and Space Museum </strong>and<strong> Central Park.&nbsp;</strong>The return flight will be to the iconic <strong>One World Trade Center.&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enjoy an incredible <strong>15 minutes</strong> flight to New York&#39;s must-see attraction.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>*You won&#39;t have the unpleasant surprise of having to pay in airport taxes on the spot: you&#39;ll pay them directly online in the next step. </em></p>",
