      "name": "Helicopter tour in New York from Manhattan",
      "description": "<p>Take off for the most popular tour and see Manhattan Island in its full glory!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This <strong>17-20 minute</strong> flight (all inclusive* !) gives you the best view of Manhattan. This flight takes you <strong>north</strong> over the <strong>George Washington Bridge</strong>, one of the busiest bridges in the world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Discover the best view of Manhattan including <strong>the Statue of Liberty, Central Park, the Empire State Building </strong>and<strong> One World Trade Center.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Discover <strong>Central Park</strong> along its entire length, <strong>Columbia University</strong> or the historic <strong>Grant&#39;s Tomb</strong>, the largest mausoleum in North America! Fly over the beautiful cliffs of <strong>New Jersey</strong> or <strong>Inwood Hill Park</strong> in northern Manhattan, the last natural forest in this urban metropolis!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Continue to <strong>Yankee Stadium</strong>, flying over <strong>Hudson</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enjoy a memorable flight and discover New York from the sky!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>*You won&#39;t have the unpleasant surprise of having to pay in airport taxes on the spot: you&#39;ll pay them directly online in the next step. </em></p>",
