      "name": "Big Apple NYC Helicopter Tour",
      "description": "<p>&nbsp;Stay longer in your comfortable helicopter seat while you enjoy <strong>the best helicopter tour in NYC</strong> and see all of the sights included in <strong>the Liberty Harbor tour,</strong> then extend your route <strong>northbound to Upper Manhatta</strong>n. Your crew flies you past <strong>midtown</strong> and <strong>all of Central Park</strong> up to <strong>Harlem and the Harlem Rive</strong>r,<strong> Columbia University</strong>, <strong>Grant&rsquo;s Tomb</strong>, <strong>the Bron</strong>x, <strong>Yankee Stadium</strong>, and over the <strong>infamous George Washington Bridge</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nView the mountainous Palisades Cliffs and make a turn south toward the most popular parts of eastern <strong>New Jersey</strong>, like Hoboken, the birthplace of Frank Sinatra. The Big City tour gives you a unique perspective into exciting worlds and sights impossible to see from any other vantage point!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nSights Include:<br />\r\n<strong>Brooklyn Bridge<br />\r\nBattery Park<br />\r\nWall Street<br />\r\nStatue of Liberty<br />\r\nEllis Island<br />\r\nOne World Trade Center<br />\r\n9/11 Memorial Site<br />\r\nEmpire State Building<br />\r\nChrysler Building<br />\r\nMadison Square Garden<br />\r\nU.S.S. Intrepid Museum<br />\r\nTimes Square<br />\r\nCentral Park<br />\r\nGrant&rsquo;s Tomb<br />\r\nGeorge Washington Bridge<br />\r\nHarlem and Harlem River<br />\r\nThe Bronx and Yankee Stadium<br />\r\nPalisades Cliffs<br />\r\nSpuyten Duyvil Bridge</strong></p>",
