      "description": "<div><p>Start your adventure with a 1-day hop-on hop-off bus tour, giving you the flexibility to explore the city at your own pace. Hop on and off the bus at any designated stop as you discover the diverse neighborhoods, famous landmarks, and hidden gems of New York City. With unlimited access for the entire day, you can create your own itinerary and spend as much time as you like at each stop.\r</p><p>Enhance your experience with a visit to the Statue of Liberty. Enjoy a roundtrip ferry ride to Liberty Island, where you can get a close-up view of this iconic symbol of freedom and democracy. Learn about the history and significance of the Statue of Liberty as you explore the grounds and see stunning views of the Manhattan skyline.</p></div>",
