      "name": "New York: Guided Walking Tour + Empire State Building 86th Floor Ticket",
      "description": "<div><p>Join a guided New York City tour to see over 30 top sights with a knowledgeable local guide. Visit the Empire State Building's open-air observatory on the 86th floor for clear views of the city.\r</p><p>Start the tour at Wall Street to see notable buildings, Ground Zero, and the New York Stock Exchange, including the Charging Bull and Fearless Girl statues. Walk to City Hall for glimpses of the Brooklyn Bridge and historic Court Houses.\r</p><p>Visit the districts of 5 Points, Chinatown, and Little Italy. See the Flatiron Building, and walk up 5th Avenue to view the Empire State Building, Chrysler Building, and Bryant Park. \r</p><p>Continue to Grand Central Station, Times Square, Rockefeller Center, and St. Patrick’s Cathedral. The tour ends at the Plaza Hotel.\r</p><p>After the tour, go to the Empire State Building's 86th-floor observatory for clear city views often featured in movies and TV shows.</p></div>",
