      "description": "<div><p>Join a New York walking tour and see over 30 top sights with a local guide. Then, view NYC from the top of the Rockefeller Center.\r</p><p>Start at Wall St. to see iconic buildings, Ground Zero, and the NY Stock Exchange along with The Charging Bull and Fearless Girl statues. Walk to City Hall, glimpse the Brooklyn Bridge, and see Court Houses known for famous Mafia trials.\r</p><p>Next, walk through the 5 Points, Chinatown, and Little Italy districts. Visit the Flatiron building and continue up 5th Avenue, seeing the Empire State Building, Chrysler Building, and Bryant Park.\r</p><p>Continue to Grand Central Train Station, Times Square, Rockefeller Center, and St. Patrick’s Cathedral. The tour ends at the Plaza Hotel.\r</p><p>After the tour, head to the Rockefeller Center for top-floor views of Manhattan. Your guide will not accompany you to the Rockefeller Center.</p></div>",
