      "description": "<div><p>The 9/11 Museum tickets give access a collection of over 10,000 artifacts from Ground Zero, including a section of antenna from the roof of the North Tower and the remains of a fire truck.\r</p><p>Browse three sections, Before 9/11, the Day of 9/11, and After 9/11, and gain insight into the day that changed the world.\r</p><p>Explore photos capturing the moments of 9/11, watch interviews, and hear firsthand accounts of the events and their aftermath, all in the space where the World Trade Center complex once was.</p></div>",
