      "name": "New York: Manhattan Guided Tour + Optional SUMMIT One Vanderbilt Entry",
      "description": "<div><p>Join a guided tour of Midtown Manhattan. Start at Times Square, surrounded by lights and crowds. Follow an English-speaking guide through the Broadway Theater District, known for its performances.\r</p><p>Walk past landmarks like Radio City Music Hall and Rockefeller Center. Visit St. Patrick’s Cathedral, a Gothic Revival building.\r</p><p>Go to Grand Central Terminal, known for its ceiling, and see the Chrysler Building. Stop by the New York Public Library and take a break in Bryant Park.\r</p><p>End the tour at SUMMIT One Vanderbilt (optional) for skyline views and unique observation deck features.</p></div>",
