      "name": "NYC: Holiday Walking Tour 5th Ave, Rockefeller Tree & Xmas Village",
      "description": "<div><p>Explore what makes New York special during the Holiday Season on a 90-minute guided walking tour of 5th Ave, featuring the stunning Holiday Windows. \r</p><p>Your expert local guide will show you why New York feels especially magical at this time of year. See the decorated windows at luxury stores like Bergdorf Goodman and Saks, and flagship stores like Cartier and Tiffany. \r</p><p>Learn the stories behind the Rockefeller Center Christmas Tree, explore the ice rink, and admire the Channel Gardens with rows of Angels. Visit the Plaza Hotel (featured in _Home Alone 2_), St Patrick's Cathedral, and Radio City Music Hall, home to the Rockettes and the Christmas Spectacular Show. \r</p><p>The tour concludes at Bryant Park's Winter Village, where you can shop, eat, and skate on the outdoor rink.</p></div>",
