      "name": "ARTECHOUSE New York: Entry Ticket",
      "description": "<div><p>Step into ARTECHOUSE New York for a journey that blends cutting-edge technology with captivating artistic creations. Move through immersive, interactive exhibits designed to pique your curiosity and reveal fresh ways of experiencing art. With installations that invite hands-on exploration, you’ll find yourself at the heart of imaginative landscapes, merging science and artistry in an entirely new format.</p><p>Exhibitions change throughout the year, each offering a unique, futuristic perspective that challenges your perception of what art can be. Whether it’s vibrant digital sculptures or mesmerizing audiovisual displays, ARTECHOUSE provides an unforgettable encounter where you become an active participant rather than a mere spectator.</p></div>",
