      "name": "New York: Secrets of Grand Central Walking Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Discover the many secrets of a New York City icon! Close to a million people pass through Grand Central Terminal every day, yet very few know the many stories and secrets that you'll get to discover on this tour. \r</p><p>Join an expert guide to uncover the origins and history of the Beaux Arts train station, from its glittering glory days to disrepair and modern quests to save it. Top-rated tour guides will make sure you experience what most miss: its hidden features, design quirks, and much more. \r</p><p>Whether you pass through it every day on your morning commute, or you're strolling through the Grand Central for the first time, you are sure to leave having learned, seen, and experienced something new and extraordinary.</p></div>",
