      "name": "Neighbourhood Eats: Brownstone Brooklyn Food Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Ready to set your tastebuds on fire? Nowhere in New York does food quite like Brooklyn’s Smith and Court Streets, and the surrounding neighborhoods. On this Brooklyn food tour, you'll join a guide to taste your palate on a culinary adventure through a vibrant mix of small, locally-owned, and artisanal food shops. \r</p><p>Discover how these unique spots came to be, and taste what makes them special. From Italian to Middle Eastern, New American to everything artisan, this NYC food tour shows you the best bites Brooklyn has to offer, from the people who make cuisine an art form. \r</p><p>Alongside the culinary offerings, you'll learn about the neighborhood’s rich history and changing character, alongside the challenges facing small business owners in New York. Find out how we can all continue to support them and keep the neighborhood vibrant and delicious!</p></div>",
