      "description": "<div><p>Immerse yourself in the glitz and glamour of the VIP Lounge before heading to the top – the Top of the Rock Observation Deck, of course! The tour guarantees expedited entry and priority elevator access for a speedy ascent to the highest point in the city. \r</p><p>Visit The Beam, an exceptional experience inspired by the famed 1932 photograph of ironworkers lunching atop a steel beam during the construction of 30 Rockefeller Plaza. \r</p><p>Visitors will find themselves securely seated on a rotating beam-like structure, soaring high above Manhattan's stunning skyline, and recreating this legendary moment.\r</p><p>Take home not just souvenirs, but unforgettable memories with the included Photo Pass. \r</p><p>Stroll through the newly revamped Gift Shop, where a generous 20% discount awaits, a perfect memento to round off this extraordinary journey.</p></div>",
