      "name": "New York: TV & Movie Guided Bus Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>This adventure through the heart of TV magic will put stars in your eyes in New York City! Snap a souvenir photo with a clapboard at the iconic *Friends* apartment building. Relive the on-screen charm at Washington Square Park, featured in *Girls*, *The Mindy Project,* *Glee*, *Someone Great*, and *When Harry Met Sally*.\r</p><p>Trace the footsteps of cinematic legends—peek at renowned hotels showcased in *American Hustle*, *Ocean’s 8*, and *Home Alone 2*. Immerse yourself in pop culture by posing in front of the legendary firehouse from the *Ghostbusters* franchise. \r</p><p>Then discover the secrets of beloved sitcoms as you catch sight of the 'Original Soup Man' and other famed *Seinfeld* locations. You'll walk through TV history, passing by iconic sites featured in *The Office* and *Modern Family*. Your journey concludes with a glimpse into the worlds of *Homeland* and *This Is Us*.\r</p><p>A must for TV and movie buffs!</p></div>",
