      "name": "New York: 30+ NYC Top Sights Walking Tour + Museum of Modern Art Entry",
      "description": "<div><p>Join the New York walking tour to see over 30 top sights with a local guide. Visit the Museum of Modern Art (MoMA) to see one of the finest collections of modern art.\r</p><p>Start at Wall Street to see buildings like the NY Stock Exchange and statues such as The Charging Bull and Fearless Girl. Walk to City Hall to catch views of the Brooklyn Bridge and Court Houses.\r</p><p>Walk through the 5 Points, Chinatown, and Little Italy. Visit the Flatiron Building and continue up 5th Avenue to see the Empire State Building, Chrysler Building, and Bryant Park.\r</p><p>Explore Grand Central Station, Times Square, Rockefeller Center, and St. Patrick’s Cathedral. The tour finishes at the Plaza Hotel.\r</p><p>After the tour, visit MoMA to see works like Van Gogh’s The Starry Night, Monet’s Water Lilies, Warhol’s Campbell’s Soup Cans, Dalí’s The Persistence of Memory, and Wyeth’s Christina’s World.</p></div>",
