      "name": "New York: 20+ Top Manhattan Sights Walking Tour + SUMMIT One Vanderbilt Entry",
      "description": "<div><p>Visit over 20 landmarks in New York City with a knowledgeable local guide. The tour starts at Wall Street, where you will walk through the oldest part of Manhattan. See Ground Zero, the Charging Bull, and Fearless Girl at the New York Stock Exchange. Afterward, continue to City Hall for views of the Brooklyn Bridge and historical courthouses.\r</p><p>Next, visit Five Points, Chinatown, and Little Italy. Learn about their cultures and get recommendations for local food spots. The tour concludes near the Flatiron Building.\r</p><p>After the guided tour, use your ticket to access SUMMIT One Vanderbilt. Go up 93 floors for views of New York City and an interactive art experience.\r</p><p>The total tour time is around 5 hours, with 3 hours for the walking tour and 2 hours at SUMMIT One Vanderbilt. The guide does not accompany you to SUMMIT One Vanderbilt.</p></div>",
