      "name": "Harlem & The Bronx: Birthplace of Hip-Hop Bus Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Reminisce and learn some things during a rare, immersive guided adventure through Harlem and the Boogie Down Bronx! You'll pass by classic backdrops with real-time narratives from iconic, charismatic hip-hop pioneers! Your guide will probably get spotted and shouted out on the streets.\r</p><p>This tour will transport you back to the early days of hip-hop. You'll get a real insight into the history and growth of this unparalleled art form, plus the chance to watch a real b-boy and b-girl dance session! \r</p><p>Go from Manhattan, to the site of the first ever hip hop party. See secret battle sites, historic clubs and famous music video and movie locations. \r</p><p>Listen to exclusive freestyles from your tour guides such as legendary emcees Grandmaster Caz, Kurtis Blow, Rahiem, Johnny Famous, Roxanne Shante, Reggie Reg and others - plus up-and-coming artists.\r</p><p>You might even get a shot at spittin’ a “hot 16” in the spotlight during the famous “Show Your Skills” segment.</p></div>",
