      "name": "New York: Manhattan Guided Walking Tour + Edge NYC Observation Deck Entry",
      "description": "<div><p>Join the tour to see 20+ landmarks in New York, then head to the Edge NYC, the highest sky deck in the Western Hemisphere.\r</p><p>The tour starts in Wall St., the oldest part of Manhattan. See Ground Zero, New York Stock Exchange, Charging Bull, and Fearless Girl. Walk to City Hall for views of the Brooklyn Bridge and notable courthouses.\r</p><p>Visit Five Points, Chinatown, and Little Italy. Learn about their cultures and where to find the best local food. The tour ends near the Flatiron Building.\r</p><p>Go to Hudson Yards and visit one of the world's best observation decks. Look through glass floors and take in the views at the highest outdoor deck in the Western Hemisphere. The guide will not join you at the Edge NYC.</p></div>",
