      "description": "<div><p>Looking for a thrilling adventure that will take your breath away? Look no further than Edge NYC, the ultimate aerial experience!\r</p><p>Start with a comprehensive safety briefing about the specially designed safety harnesses. Once you're secure, your expert City Climb Guides will attach you to two cables connected to a trolley that seamlessly moves with you throughout the entire journey.\r</p><p>As you make your way up the exterior of the building, you'll have the chance to look down upon the stunning New York City skyline and even lean out across the building's open edges. With no obstructions in sight, the views are truly breathtaking!\r</p><p>But that's not all - the experience culminates with a celebratory award and a victory lap of Edge NYC's indoor/outdoor viewing areas. \r</p><p>Enjoy a toast in the sky at our champagne bar or café, or take in the sights on our outdoor glass-floor experience, angled glass walls, and skyline steps.</p></div>",
