      "name": "Washington DC: Guided Day Trip from New York",
      "description": "<div><p>Take off for an intriguing trip from the buzzing metropolis of New York City to the political powerhouse of Washington DC. This guided tour offers a rich knowledge of history, politics, and iconic sights.\r</p><p>The tour takes you through New Jersey, Delaware, and Maryland, showcasing the East Coast's cultural kaleidoscope. Upon reaching DC, you'll be fascinated by the historical and political prowess of Capitol Hill, the nerve center of the US Congress. Admire the White House, a beacon of presidential pomp and power.\r</p><p>A visit to the Vietnam Memorial serves as a poignant tribute to the nation's tenacity, while Arlington Cemetery, home to JFK's grave, resonates with stories of bravery and sacrifice.\r</p><p>Witness the architectural wonder and bustling energy of Union Station, a hotspot for shopping and dining. The tour reaches its crescendo with a scenic city tour, engrossing you in the majesty of DC.</p></div>",
