      "description": "<div><p>Join a guided tour to Niagara Falls from New York that includes a 1-night hotel stay with continental breakfast.\r</p><p>Head north to pass the Delaware Water Gap and arrive at Watkins Glen State Park in the Finger Lakes region. Walk through Watkins Glen Canyon to see waterfalls, then continue to Niagara Falls (in winter, visit Montour Falls).\r</p><p>Tour the US side of Niagara, including American Falls, Goat Island, and 3 Sisters Islands. In the evening, see the colorful lights on the falls. Witness the powerful force of the water of Niagara Falls. See Horseshoe Falls up close aboard the Maid of the Mist  (available May-October).\r</p><p>In winter (when Maid of the Mist is closed), visit the Power Vista Hydroelectric station and the Cave of the Winds or Journey Behind the Falls.\r</p><p>At noon, head south to New York State. On the way, stop at a large outlet mall for shopping, finding deals at brand-name stores.</p></div>",
