      "name": "Central Park Bike Rentals",
      "description": "<div><p>You want to be a part of it, New York, New York! But after a while all those honking taxi horns and crowded sidewalks can make your brain hurt. Enter Central Park, an emerald green oasis in the middle of the madness. Rent a bike for a day and cruise this urban wilderness. Escape to Strawberry Fields, roll past lakes and lochs, sniff out the hotdog sellers, and become part of Manhattan. The city is yours.</p><p>There is so much to see and do around Central Park that listing them here would be a near impossible task. That is the beauty of our Bike Rentals, you have the freedom to explore, discover and seek out whatever you desire. Without a guide dragging you around, that bagel? Bought. That trail? Discovered. Those sights? Seen!</p></div>",
