      "name": "Edge admission tickets",
      "description": "<div><p>You’ve never experienced New York like this before! The highest outdoor sky deck in the Western Hemisphere, Edge is the Big Apple's newest attraction. Enjoy an immersive multimedia experience before heading up 1,100 feet and arriving at the outdoor sky deck. The deck is suspended in mid-air, and you'll feel as if you're floating in the sky as you walk on the glass floor and lean out over the city.You can choose between the following options available in the order box: the Edge GA ticket (Option 1) which is a dated ticket with a specific time slot for your visit, the Edge Flex Admission ticket (Option 2) which is a dated ticket without any specific time slot for your visit, or the Edge Express Admission ticket (Option 3) which is a dated ticket without any specific time slot for your visit and additional skip-the-line and priority elevator access.Option 1: <strong>Edge GA</strong> – Book a date and time for your visit\nOption 2: <strong>Edge Flex Admission –</strong> Book a date and come any time\nOption 3: <strong>Edge Express Admission –</strong> Book a date, come any time, skip-the-line plus priority elevator access</p></div>",
