      "name": "Brooklyn, Williamsburg and Greenpoint Underground Donut Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Get ready to go on the brand-new Brooklyn &amp; Williamsburg Donut Tour! With the Manhattan version being such a success, Brooklyn is now another newly chosen area. Home to some of America’s most iconic donut shops including Doughnut Plant, Peter Pan Doughnuts and many more, you'll get to explore this charming neighborhood and munch on these delicious tasty treats. Check out McCarren park stopping along the way to talk about Brooklyn history, culture, and countless gorgeous sights.\nThe tour is a little over a mile of walking, running with rain or shine, so bring weather-appropriate clothing and a healthy appetite. Looking forward to hosting you soon!</p></div>",
