      "name": "NYC Combo: The Edge Observation Deck, St Patrick's Cathedral and Dave & Buster's",
      "description": "<div><p>Get ready to explore New York City's finest and newest observatory. On this tour, see the gorgeous \"Edge\" at Hudson Yards, the iconic St Patrick's Cathedral and then enjoy lunch at \"Dave &amp; Buster's\" in Times Square. Your lunch will include an entree, dessert, unlimited non-alcoholic drinks and a $5 Play Card for the arcade.\nWith your entry ticket to The Edge at Hudson Yard's, see the protruding 100-stories-high observation deck, with a glass floor, with 360-degree NYC-style views and bar! Next, experience the 160-year history of St. Patrick’s Cathedral shared by the men and women who know it best in this official audio tour. Cardinal Timothy Dolan, Monsignor Robert Ritchie and others will guide you around St. Patrick's. They tell their personal stories about what makes St. Patrick’s America's favorite.</p></div>",
