      "name": "New York Celebrity Homes Self-Guided Walking Audio Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Embark on an exciting New York Celebrity Walking Tour and uncover the fascinating stories of the city’s most famous residents. Wander through iconic streets and discover the connections between New York and some of today’s biggest stars. Walk where Jay-Z and Tom Brady have left their mark, hear about Taylor Swift’s life in the city, and explore the glamour of Heidi Klum’s fashionable world.This tour takes you through vibrant neighborhoods like Soho and Greenwich Village, visiting hotspots such as W Broadway, Canal St, and Washington Square Park. From music legends like David Bowie to modern superstars like Chrissy Teigen and John Legend, you’ll dive into the lives of celebrities who call New York home.Celebrities featured include:• Jay-Z• Tom Brady• Taylor Swift• Bethenny Frankel• Zayn Malik• Heidi Klum• John Legend• Chrissy Teigen• David Bowie• Julianna Margulies• Nicki Minaj• Cardi B• Anderson Cooper• Alec Baldwin• Josh CharlesExplore landmarks like E Houston St and E 10th St, where stories of stars such as Nicki Minaj, Cardi B, and Alec Baldwin come to life. Learn about the careers, controversies, and achievements of these famous figures. While these stops highlight NYC’s celebrity history, remember that privacy is key—celebrity homes and haunts may be obscured or tucked away in private areas.Join us for this journey through the heart of New York, where every story brings you closer to the city’s rich celebrity culture!</p></div>",
