      "name": "Seaport, Brooklyn Heights and DUMBO Walking Guided Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Get ready to experience the essence of Brooklyn on this carefully crafted tour. Start your adventure in Manhattan's South Street Seaport Historic District, where cobblestone streets are lined by modern landmarks. Your guide will take you on a short walk through this charming neighborhood and share stories of its rich maritime history while you soak up the vibrant waterfront atmosphere. Next, it's time to cross the East River in style on a scenic ferry ride. Enjoy stunning views of Manhattan and Brooklyn as you cruise toward your next stop. Arriving in Brooklyn, treat yourself to a's Pizzeria. Relax and savor an iconic NYC bite in an authentic local spot. Continue to Brooklyn Bridge Park, a serene space offering unparalleled views of Manhattan's skyline. Nearby, make a quick visit to Squibb Park, a hidden gem that showcases Brooklyn's urban greenery. From there, you'll set off on a stroll through Brooklyn Heights, an upscale neighborhood brimming with charm. Walk along the Brooklyn Promenade and pass literary landmarks like the homes of Norman Mailer and Truman Capote. In DUMBO, capture one of the most Instagram-worthy views in NYC: cobblestone streets leading to a perfectly framed view of the Manhattan Bridge. Your tour wraps up at the Brooklyn Bridge. You'll say goodbye to your guide at the start of the bridge, after which you can either walk across it or continue exploring Brooklyn on your own.</p></div>",
