      "name": "Soho, Chinatown and Little Italy audio-guide walking tour app",
      "description": "<div><p>If you have a vivid interest in history and culture but, at the same time, you do not want to miss the distinctive gastronomic experiences in NYC, then this tour is entirely dedicated to you. Start your walk next to Green Street Park in Soho, where you'll see the world’s best collection of cast iron buildings. In Little Italy, be ready to explore a twisted but inspiring history of immigration that will show you the true origins of New York.The walk ends in Chinatown, but before that, you'll learn about Chinese cuisine and stop at Columbus Park for the famous Five Points. Plus, by the finish you'll increase your knowledge on how the former suburb of New York became its industrial center, then an abandoned area for poor artists, and later one of the most expensive and luxurious places on the planet. </p></div>",
