      "description": "<div><p>The OvR Rockaway Beach Bus is back! This old New York institution on the rise after surviving the devastating effects of Hurricane Sandy. This experience will be teaming up with some of the best brands on the NYC Summer scene to get Manhattan and Brooklyn out to Rockaway, Riis Park and Fort Tilden for a summer of fun with the best NYC beach experience in the game. The OvR Rockaway Beach Bus!By going on this experience you'll be supporting a rebuilding scene and a great day at the beach! At Rockaway you can rent a board and get surf lessons, bar hop or keep it mellow and just chill out on the beach, no matter what you’re into The OvR Rockaway Beach Bus has you covered! With exclusive deals at a variety of local spots including restaurants, hotels, and shops, you are guaranteed to get the authentic New York City beach experience! </p></div>",
