      "name": "American Dream TilT Museum Admission Ticket",
      "description": "<div><p>Step into the magical realm of renowned urban art maestro, Tracy Stum, and become part of the artwork itself. This experience is nestled within the American Dream, a sprawling complex developed by Triple Five Group. Located just a stone's throw away from New York City in East Rutherford, New Jersey, this 3 million square foot wonderland offers an unrivalled blend of world-class entertainment, retail, and dining.The American Dream houses a plethora of leading attractions. From water parks and theme parks to discovery centres and aquariums, there's something for everyone. For thrill-seekers, there's even a ski hill and a towering 300-foot observation wheel offering panoramic views of the NYC skyline. Soon to debut are exciting additions like a game room and go-kart academy.But it's not all about entertainment; the American Dream also boasts an immersive luxury shopping and dining experience known as The Avenue. Here, you'll find high-end fashion retailers, fine-dining Italian restaurants, and much more. The retail collection is further enhanced with flagship stores for popular clothing brands, beauty products, and toys. Unique offerings include the only standalone toy store location in the U.S., the first-ever physical burger restaurant of a famous YouTuber, and the world’s first and only “candy department store”.</p></div>",
