      "name": "Madame Tussauds New York Ticket with Marvel 4D and 7D Experience",
      "description": "<div><p>Prepare to be star-struck with your entrance tickets to Madame Tussauds New York, located in the heart of Times Square. From Marilyn to Madonna to Lady Gaga, you are guaranteed to come face-to-face with an icon from every generation.Voted as one of New York's most unique attractions, you'll explore five floors of interactive entertainment - spread over over 85,000 square feet. Walk up to your favorite celebrity and strike a pose with more than 200 life-like wax figures of the biggest A-listed actors, music entertainers, sports legends and global leaders. Feel the empire state of mind seated at the piano with Alicia Keys, practice your catwalk on the NY fashion runway, or pull up a chair next to Jimmy Fallon on the Tonight Show.Feel the power of Marvel superheroes in the thrilling MARVEL Universe 4D cinema experience, which includes wind-chilling, water-soaking, and face-flinching special effects. Become fully immersed in a 7D carnival adventure where you shoot lasers at enemy characters to survive. Play against your family and friends in this multi-sensory interactive game.Your ticket also includes a Digital Photo Pass. You'll receive a QR code at the museum to scan at the photo kiosks. The pass allows you to download all your content directly to your mobile device to view, save, or share.</p></div>",
