      "name": "New York Jets football game ticket at Metlife Stadium",
      "description": "<div><p>A cultural icon within the NFL, the New York Jets are a staple of their community. Historically, the representatives of areas such as Long Island, Queens and Brooklyn, the Jets are an embodiment of New York culture. Immerse yourself in “Gang Green” and get a cultural perspective of New York like no other.MetLife Stadium is one of the most iconic stadiums in the NFL. One of the largest NFL stadiums, with a capacity of 82,500, MetLife offers an array of amenities. Sample some of the local delicacies, head out to the tailgate, mingle with the locals and grab yourself something fresh from the grill.The glamour of New York City can certainly be felt at Jets’ games. With some of the league's biggest stars on the field and a celebrity cohort of fans, it’s always a star-studded occasion at MetLife. Whether you’re a die-hard football fan or just want to get that magical New York experience, there’s no better trip than attending a Jets game at MetLife.</p></div>",
