      "description": "<div><p>Experience the beauty of Central Park from the comfort of a guided pedicab tour. This leisurely journey is ideal for visitors of all ages, offering a distinctive way to explore one of New York City's most renowned parks.As you travel, pause for photographs at scenic locations including a beautiful lake, bridges, fountains, and historic landmarks featured in your favourite films and TV shows. The guide shares fun stories, historical facts, and pop culture trivia to enhance the experience.This tour is particularly suited for those wishing to see much in a limited time without too much walking. With numerous stops and great views, it provides a perfect way to appreciate one of the world's most celebrated urban green spaces.</p></div>",
