      "description": "<div><p>Enjoy your time in New York and explore some of the best parts of the US in a nutshell with a combo tour to three major east coast destinations: Washington DC, Niagara Falls, and Philadelphia.Your expert bilingual guide will give you the very best insights and round-trip transport from downtown Manhattan. The tour package eliminates the stress of navigating and planning on your own. Your guide will show you all the city’s major highlights, ensuring you see and learn as much as possible along the way. On the first day of this combo tour, you'll travel to Niagara Falls. Please note that the journey will take 7-8 hours, each way. Upon arrival, experience the adventure, beauty, and natural wonder of Niagara Falls on board the historic Maid of the Mist boat cruise or from other observation points when the Maid of the Mist is not running.Two days later depart to Washington D.C. to see the White House and the Capitol Building from the outside. After some free time for lunch, head to Philadelphia and discover its most iconic sights. </p></div>",
