      "name": "Guided walking tour through Chinatown, Little Italy and SoHo",
      "description": "<div><p>Join a guided walking tour through the heart of New York City. This experience begins in the district of Chinatown, where the streets brim with energy, colour, and tradition. Pause to savour some dumplings as your guide unravels the history and heritage of one of America's oldest and most dynamic Chinese communities.Your next stop is Little Italy, where the scent of fresh espresso and baked pastries fills the air. Here, you have the opportunity to enjoy delectable treats and cannolis while learning about the traditions and cuisine of the Italian community that made this place their home.Your exploration concludes in SoHo, a district known for its cast-iron architecture, art galleries, and trendy boutiques. Stroll along cobblestone streets while your guide narrates the transformation of this once-industrial area into a globally recognised hub for creativity, design, and culture.This tour offers a glimpse into the diverse tapestry that makes up the city that never sleeps.</p></div>",
