      "name": "Empire State Building Guided Tour with Observation Deck Access",
      "description": "<div><p>Experience new heights in the Big Apple and admire the breathtaking views of the city.Discover the pinnacle of New York City with this tour, offering an exclusive journey through one of the world’s most iconic landmarks. Begin your adventure with early access, allowing you to bypass the crowds and enjoy a peaceful start to your day.Your ascent starts in the stunning art-deco lobby, where a high-speed elevator whisks you up to the 86th-floor observatory. From this vantage point, take in breathtaking 360-degree views of Manhattan, its boroughs, and even glimpses of five different states.With a small group of no more than 15 people, your expert local guide will provide insightful commentary, pointing out key landmarks and sharing captivating stories about the Empire State Building’s rich history. This tour goes beyond the views, offering you a deeper understanding of the significance behind what you’re seeing.The experience continues on the 80th floor at the Dare to Dream Exhibit, where you’ll dive into the building’s fascinating construction history. Learn about the incredible engineering and dedication that brought this architectural marvel to life.</p></div>",
