      "name": "Brooklyn Bridge and DUMBO 2 Hour Guided Walking Tour in New York",
      "description": "<div><p>Experience the marvels of the Brooklyn Bridge and the artistic energy of DUMBO.Begin your journey at the Oculus, a striking architectural gem, where your expert guide will introduce you to the rich history and engineering brilliance of the Brooklyn Bridge. As you walk towards City Hall Park, you'll explore the 19th-century origins of this iconic structure. Stroll across the bridge's pedestrian walkway, capturing stunning views of the Manhattan skyline and East River.Next, dive into the creative heart of DUMBO, where cobblestone streets lead you through a trendy neighbourhood filled with galleries, boutiques, and eateries. Discover prime photo spots, including the famous view of the Manhattan Bridge from Washington Street, and soak in the scenic beauty of Brooklyn Bridge Park. Conclude your tour at Fulton Ferry Landing, where DUMBO's vibrant food and entertainment scene awaits. This tour offers an unforgettable exploration of New York City's dynamic history, culture, and architecture.</p></div>",
