      "name": "Metropolitan Museum Guided Tour with Skip-the-Line Ticket",
      "description": "<div><p>Skip the lines and explore the Met’s masterpieces with your knowledgeable guide.Discover the best of the Metropolitan Museum of Art on this expertly guided tour. Dive into 5,000 years of art, exploring the Met’s greatest masterpieces in just two hours. After meeting your guide at the entrance, you’ll start your journey in the Great Hall before heading to the Egyptian Wing, where the Temple of Dendur stands as a monument to ancient civilizations.Next, explore the American Wing, where iconic works like \"Washington Crossing the Delaware\" await. Contrast these with European masterpieces by Velázquez, Rembrandt, and Van Gogh. The tour continues into Modern Art, showcasing vibrant pieces by Pollock, Warhol, and Picasso, each with fascinating stories shared by your guide.During the summer, your experience culminates with access to the Met’s rooftop garden, offering stunning views of Central Park and the Manhattan skyline. This tour is the perfect way to experience the Met, blending culture, history, and art in an unforgettable journey.</p></div>",
