      "name": "Summit One Vanderbilt Experience and Midtown Manhattan Guided Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Explore the iconic sights of midtown Manhattan and enjoy a stunning view from the Summit One Vanderbilt.Dive into the vibrant energy of midtown Manhattan, starting with Times Square’s dazzling lights and bustling atmosphere. Your expert guide will lead you through the Broadway Theater District, home to world-famous musicals. Marvel at Radio City Music Hall’s art deco elegance, then visit the Rockefeller Center, a cultural and historical hub.Step inside St. Patrick’s Cathedral, a gothic revival gem among Fifth Avenue’s luxury shops. Continue to Grand Central Terminal, renowned for its celestial ceiling and rich history. Admire the Chrysler Building’s iconic spire and explore the neoclassical New York Public Library, a testament to the city’s commitment to culture and knowledge. Enjoy a serene break at Bryant Park.Finish your tour with a visit to the SUMMIT at One Vanderbilt. From this elevated viewpoint, enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of the Manhattan skyline, capturing the city’s grandeur and energy from above. </p></div>",
