      "name": "SUMMIT One Vanderbilt and Manhattan Walking Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Discover the best of New York’s vibrant Manhattan district and see over 20 of the city’s most iconic landmarks, then head up the iconic SUMMIT One Vanderbilt for epic city views and a unique interactive art experience!The tour begins on the world-famous Wall Street, the oldest part of Manhattan. Soak up the unique atmosphere of this busy district, and see some of the city’s most recognizable sights including Ground Zero and The Charging Bull &amp; Fearless Girl statues at the New York Stock Exchange. Walking to City Hall, we glimpse the Brooklyn Bridge and the famous Court Houses that took down the Mafia.Next, head to the Five Points, China Town, and Little Italy. Learn about the vibrant culture of these neighborhoods and the people who live here, as well as tips on the best local places to eat some amazing NYC food, before finishing the tour near the iconic Flatiron Building in Midtown Manhattan.After the tour witness the views over New York City with a ticket to SUMMIT One Vanderbilt. Ascend 93 floors and step into an immersive, multi-sensory art experience!The tour is approximately 5 hours in duration (3 hours Manhattan Walking Tour &amp; 2 hours at SUMMIT One Vanderbilt. Your guide will not accompany you inside SUMMIT One Vanderbilt).</p></div>",
