      "name": "The Banksy Museum NYC Entry Tickets",
      "description": "<div><p>Step beyond the streets and into the largest Banksy exhibition in the world, in New York City! This 15,000-square-foot immersive experience takes you deep into the mind of one of the most mysterious, rebellious, and influential artists of our time.Banksy’s art has shaken governments, challenged the status quo, and redefined street art as a movement. You can experience his most iconic works up close—from life-size recreations of his famous murals to rare studio pieces and stunning installations that bring his vision to life.This isn’t just a museum—it’s an interactive journey through the raw power of Banksy’s message. Perfect for art lovers, families, and the curious alike, this exhibition invites you to question, feel, and immerse yourself in the world of a true creative disruptor. Come and enjoy this unparalleled artistic experience!</p></div>",
