      "name": "Walking tour of DUMBO with cultural insights and food tasting",
      "description": "<div><p>Embark on a walking tour of DUMBO, an experience that transcends the typical food tour. As you savour the exceptional flavours of Brooklyn, your guide will enrich your journey with cultural insights, historical anecdotes and remarkable sights.Step back into 1776, standing at the very spot where General Washington made a crucial decision to safeguard his outnumbered troops. Fast forward less than a century, and Brooklyn once again finds itself at the heart of history, housing a humble red brick church that served as a pivotal stop on the Underground Railroad.Your guide will regale you with tales of DUMBO's past and present while introducing you to some of its culinary delights. Sample a slice of Sicilian pizza from a renowned local eatery or indulge in some of the finest seafood from a popular regional restaurant. Satisfy your sweet tooth with creations from a celebrated chocolatier known for his Netflix fame.From the pebbled shores of a local beach to a transformed warehouse now bustling with retail activity, and panoramic views of iconic bridges, discover the best of DUMBO through the eyes of a local privy to its hidden gems.</p></div>",
