      "name": "New York SoHo District tour with a city exploration game",
      "description": "<div><p>Spend time in New York’s SoHo District by solving challenges and unlocking stories on your phone, leading to new places and amazing stories.Bleecker Street is where you'll start the engaging exploration game, re-enacting the role of someone who just bumped into a man with the kindest eyes you’ve ever seen. It'll take you around an hour and a half to complete, and you can also explore at your own pace: pause the game and resume anytime from the location where you paused it. Finish at Mishka SoHo Restaurant having had so much fun.</p></div>",
