      "name": "Six Sensational Courses In A Modern Brooklyn Studio",
      "description": "Six Sensational Courses In A Modern Brooklyn StudioThe Pimento experience and studio highlights the traditional aesthetics of Caribbean cuisine by presenting a new wave of seasonal dishes. The family-style menu is a modern take on a Caribbean family dinner featuring a curated medley of seasonal produce and fresh ingredients. To compliment the experience, Chef Tiyan has paired signature beverages to mirror the menu, which allows the distinct flavors to shine.• Family-style menu• Seasonal produce and fresh ingredients• Paired signature beverages to mirror the menu• Enjoy a 6-course meal in a modern culinary studioAbout your host, Toya: undefinedA multi-course family-style menu including six shared courses and beveragesChef driven dining experience and menu prepared with a seasonal selection of local organic ingredientsTo complement the family-style brunch experience, Toya offers curated signature beverages to mirror the menuPrivate dining in a modern designed studio with a Caribbean touch featuring custom art designed by Shatha Al DafaiGuests can also enjoy the attached Mauby Parlor lounge space for conversation and a drinks before brunch begins Pimento Family-Style MenuHerbal Chili PetitesNectarine, mango, gingerBasa Crudo Choquette, kyuri, husk tomatoCitrus Chana SaladParsley, lime, alliumsBrown Stew BranzinoBeef tomato, sweet peppers, swiss chardGarden ChickenGreen onion, pea shoots, wild coconut riceShirley’s NectarNashi, mango, caramelDrinks & BeveragesRose SpritzRose, blackberry, hibiscusPimento PunchGuava, papaya, soursopChef's Blessings Chilled TeaCoconut, rooibos, marigoldSpring Citrus WaterLime, lemon, orange",
