      "name": "No Diet Club: Best Food in Downtown Brooklyn // Cobble Hill",
      "description": "Join the latest culinary trend of immersive and social dining where local hosts invite you into their homes for a magical meal.<br><br>After shining light on the best foods all over Europe since 2017, your favorite group of French foodies at the No Diet Club have decided to expand across the pond.\n\nGuided by a local foodie, this tour features a 4 hour tribute to NYC’s most iconic and historically relevant foods such as finest ingredients pizza by the slice, chopped cheese, authentic beef patties, fluffy doughnuts and many more, as well as a gorgeous stroll among the historical Brownstone townhomes in the culturally eclectic borough of Brooklyn.\n\nTastings may vary with the seasons / vegetarians are welcome\n\nWhat we offer ✔\n\n- Many tastings to share\n- Calories\n- A nice walk in Brooklyn\n- What locals eat\n- Lots of fun\n- Funny/bad jokes\n- Pictures and souvenirs\n- Smiles\n- A list of serious recommendations in NYC\n- New friends from all around the world",
