      "name": "Multi-Course Outdoor Balkan Dinner // LIC",
      "description": "Join the latest culinary trend of immersive and social dining where local hosts invite you into their homes for a magical meal.<br><br>Take a trip with Vlada & Ian to Eastern Europe with this multi-course Bulgarian feast in Long Island City, Queens.  Upon arrival guests will be greeted with a welcome cocktail followed by 4-courses of Bulgarian specialties and favorites that are well known to the country. Vlada, being a Bulgarian native, will walk the guests through the origin of each dish while putting her own spin on traditional recipes, and cultivating a unique experience in a fun and friendly atmosphere. Ian & Vlada love to host and meet new people and cannot wait to welcome you into their Long Island City home.\n\nPrepare for a pun-filled menu and bring any drinks, if you so desire!",
