      "name": "Afternoon Turkish Coffee + Fortune Telling Experience // East Village ",
      "description": "Looking for an exotic experience in the East Village? Look no further than Dr. Honeybrew's Turkish coffee reading and fortune telling sessions! Step into a world of mysticism and intrigue as you sip on a piping hot cup of traditional Turkish coffee and let Dr. Honeybrew decipher your future. With his expert knowledge of ancient divination techniques dating back to the Ottoman empire of the 1600's and his keen intuition, Dr. Honeybrew will reveal insights and guidance to help you navigate life's twists and turns. Book your session today for a unique and unforgettable experience that will leave you feeling enlightened and inspired!\n\nWhat to expect:\n• Turkish style coffee prepared on a pot of hot burning sand\n• A visual fortune-telling experience unlike any other. Your coffee grinds are interpreted right before your eyes!\n• These readings are always fun, light-hearted, but most importantly - insightful!\n• A unique gift to take home by Dr. Honeybrew",
