      "description": "<div><p>Make your way to Pier 62 at the north end of the Chelsea Piers Complex in Manhattan ahead of your boarding time to check in. Board the boat, complete with festive decorations, and soak up the views, including the Manhattan skyline, One World Observatory, Ellis Island, and the Statue of Liberty, as the boat cruises around.</p><p>During your cruise, enjoy an assortment of complimentary handmade holiday cookies and one included spiked hot cocoa beverage (with more available for purchase by credit card). Listen to a live jazz band and sing along to Christmas carols.</p><p>The cruise ends back at Pier 62 at Chelsea Piers.</p></div>",
