      "name": "New York City Harlem Gospel Choir Concert",
      "description": "<div><p>Experience the joy of a Harlem gospel concert in person, with a guide who will take care of all the details. Immerse yourself as you dance and sing along to the music of an authentic and professional gospel choir at a Black historic church in New York City’s storied Harlem neighborhood. You and a group will meet up beforehand and enter the church together for the musical fellowship—it’s not a church service so everyone can feel comfortable and welcome to join in.</p></div>",
