      "name": "Night Walking Tour Path of Liberty with Ferry to Wall Street Bull",
      "description": "<div><p>This immersive NYC experience gives you the flexibility to explore at your own pace, guided by rich storytelling and location-based directions. Begin at Freedom Plaza and walk through Path of Liberty, a powerful outdoor art installation reflecting American identity. While we’re not affiliated with the exhibit, your virtual guide brings context, meaning, and depth to every stop.</p><p>Next, hop aboard the NYC Ferry from East 34th Street to Wall Street, passing iconic skyline views, historic bridges, and a glimpse of the Statue of Liberty. Your journey ends at the Charging Bull (Wall Street Bull) in the quiet glow of the Financial District at night — offering a new way to see one of NYC’s most photographed landmarks.</p><p>This is more than a walking tour — it’s a story-driven journey through the heart of liberty, resilience, and transformation in New York City. No set schedules, no groups — just your own personal guide through the city’s past and present.</p></div>",
