      "name": "Official Central Park Movie Location Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>With its iconic locations and picturesque landscapes, it’s no wonder the Park is one of the most filmed locations in the world, appearing in beloved movies and TV shows. Whether you search for Enchanted and Hair wonderlands, the dramatic settings of Angels in America and Avengers, or where The Muppets Take Manhattan, you can explore the storied setting to your TV and movie favorites on this Central Park on Screen tour.</p><p>Join us for this special tour to view Central Park through a director’s lens and explore what Central Park’s TV and movies reveal about the connection between the Park and New York City. This official Central Park tour is the only one to reveal behind-the-scenes secrets of filming in Central Park – as the caretakers of Central Park, our teams work daily with film and TV crews, from indie productions to major Hollywood blockbusters.</p></div>",
