      "description": "<div><p>Central Park. Rockefeller Center. Fifth Avenue. Times Square. Grand Central.</p><p>Interested in digging deep into the secrets embedded in the city's most iconic landmarks? Duck into Central Park to escape from the hustle and bustle before living out postcard New York from the streets as I show off the very best Midtown Manhattan has to offer!</p><p>Featuring a detailed look at the architecture of some of the city's most decadent buildings and the fascinating social history which has transformed the city from a small, peaceful island into the busiest, most decadent island in the world. Highlights include: Central Park, Rockefeller Center, Carnegie Hall, Billionaire's Row, Fifth Avenue fashion, Times Square, the New York Public Library, Grand Central Terminal, the Chrysler Building, the modern skyscrapers of Park Avenue, and a sweeping tour of Broadway, New York's most iconic street.</p></div>",
