      "name": "NYC Battery Park and Statue of Liberty NYC Walking Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>See the Statue of Liberty from the best vantage point in New York City! While admiring the iconic statue, learn all about its creation, its symbolism, and how such an enormous sculpture made it all the way from France to the US!</p><p>Then, look across the sparkling waters to Ellis Island, and hear about the waves of European newcomers who came here “yearning to breathe free” and transformed the city forever.</p><p>Plus, Battery Park contains all sorts of hidden gems most visitors never find! What’s the story behind the grim sculpture of a drowning man half-hidden by the water? How about that unusual clock on the pier? Uncover the riveting history behind all this and more!</p><p>This self-guided tour allows you to explore New York’s historic wonders with maximum flexibility and value. </p><p>We’ll email or text you your unique password within 30 minutes after you book the tour. All audios play automatically based on location.</p><p>No expiration — The tour comes with lifetime validity!</p></div>",
