      "name": "Private New York City Pizza Tasting With a Local",
      "description": "<div><p>What's the best slice of pizza in New York City? Find out for yourself. From classics to modern interpretations pushing the boundaries of pizza making, join me on this all-inclusive walking tour through Lower Manhattan to discover the city's best pizza. By sampling four of New York's most notorious pizzerias, you'll get a taste for the wide range of styles and flavors which make the pizza here so unique. I've tried all the best (and some of the worst) pizza in the city—I know exactly which hidden gems to visit and which tourist traps to avoid. Join me and discover what the secret is to a great slice of New York pizza, learn essential New York history, and answer pizza trivia questions bound to challenge even the most dedicated pizza experts out there. By the end of the day, you'll be as well-versed on New York pizza as any local, and be able to answer New York's most important question for yourself.</p></div>",
