      "name": "New York Giants Football Game Ticket at MetLife Stadium",
      "description": "<div><p>Step into the storied world of the New York Giants, where tradition meets excitement in every game. With a rich legacy that includes four Super Bowl championships, the Giants embody the glitz, the glamour and also the heart of New York football. Going to MetLife is a must for any football fan!</p><p>MetLife Stadium is a modern marvel, offering excellent amenities and comfortable seating. With impressive sight-lines and giant video boards, fans can immerse themselves in the action from anywhere in the stadium. Being part of the New York sports scene adds an extra layer of excitement, the intensity and passion of New York sports fans is like no other and to experience that is truly special.</p><p>Tailgating at MetLife is a must for any visitor to New York. The Giants tailgate scene is legendary, immerse yourself with locals and experience game day like a true Giants fan. With drinks flowing, music blasting and delicious food always on the go, this your chance to become part of the Giants family!</p></div>",
