      "name": "Half-Day Hell's Kitchen Food Tour and Central Park Stroll",
      "description": "<div><p>Begin your day in Hell’s Kitchen, a once-notorious district now buzzing with global flavors and hidden gems. Taste your way around this neighborhood as your guide shares local lore—complete with tales of historic gangs, immigrant influences, and the bright lights of nearby Broadway. Savor multicultural dishes while uncovering how crime and culture molded Hell’s Kitchen into the thriving hotspot it is today.</p><p>After indulging in a variety of bites, transition to the lush greenery of Central Park. Stroll through this urban oasis with a knowledgeable guide who reveals fascinating stories behind its iconic bridges, statues, and secret corners. To out-of-towners, the park might feel like a dream destination, but for New Yorkers, it’s our cherished backyard. Embrace this quintessential NYC experience, walking off your delicious Hell’s Kitchen treats amid the park’s natural beauty and storied history.</p></div>",
