      "description": "<div><p>Indulge in a sophisticated three-course prix-fixe lunch at Trattoria del Arte, located just steps from Carnegie Hall and Broadway. This culinary experience features a selection of classic Italian dishes, expertly crafted to offer a taste of Italy amidst the vibrant energy of Midtown. Guests can savor a starter like Italian Wedding Soup or Caprese Salad, followed by a choice of delectable mains such as Spaghetti &amp; Short Rib Meatballs or True North Canadian Salmon. Conclude your meal with a delightful dessert, including Cannoli or Tiramisu. Perfect for theatergoers enjoy a refined lunch that captures the cultural essence of New York.</p></div>",
