      "name": "New York City SoHo, Little Italy & Chinatown Walking Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Visit three major New York neighborhoods—SoHo, Little Italy, and Chinatown—on this immersive walking tour. Follow your local guide through cobblestone streets, past cast-iron buildings, and into historic sites linked to mob legends and immigrant stories. Discover old Mafia hangouts, former opium dens, and the city’s original police headquarters while learning about NYC’s gritty past and vibrant cultural evolution.</p></div>",
