      "name": "Shop Second-Hand + Vintage Fashion in New York City",
      "description": "<div><p>Embrace the thrill of New York’s ever-evolving vintage scene on a 2.5 to 3-hour journey led by a fashion-savvy insider. In a city famed for its trendsetting style, we’ll cut through the noise to uncover the second-hand gems worth your time—think coveted labels, one-of-a-kind finds, and timeless classics.</p><p>Kick off at a cozy café meetup, then venture to at least four specially curated shops where you’ll have ample time to browse and try on. Your guide’s expert eye will help you spot hidden treasures, and by tour’s end, you’ll have a custom store map so you can keep exploring on your own.</p><p><strong>Why You’ll Love It:</strong>\n• Discover vintage and resale pieces (sizes 0–10) at wallet-friendly prices.\n• Spend a relaxed 20–30 minutes in each boutique, ensuring a personalized experience.\n• Enjoy a small, intimate group capped at just six shoppers.\n• Leave with a complimentary map featuring 30+ top stores.\n• Start from a convenient Manhattan meetup point.\n• Upgrade to a private tour with flexible dates and times for a tailor-made outing.</p></div>",
