      "description": "<div><p>Visit four New York City neighbourhoods with a private guide all in one tour: Greenwich, Little Italy, Soho, and Chinatown. Throughout your tour, your guide will give you the history and immerse you in the vibe of each local pocket of culture. First visit Greenwich Village, which was known historically as the Bohemian capital for unconventional lifestyles. Next, stroll through Soho, renowned for its art galleries, museums, architecture, and various shopping options. Then continue through Little Italy and Chinatown, while learning about the history of immigration and immigrant diaspores in the city. At the end of your tour, your guide will give you recommendations for the best way to continue your immersive exploration –whether you’re craving pizza, dumplings, or splurging at one of the city’s shopping meccas. </p></div>",
