      "name": "Niagara Falls, Toronto, and 1000 Islands 3-Day Tour from NYC",
      "description": "<div><p>This 3-day, 2-country experience begins in Midtown in New York City. </p><p>Travel north through Upstate New York to Watkins Glen State Park (or Montour Falls, depending on the season) and the scenic Finger Lakes region en route to Niagara Falls, and enjoy a hike to scenic waterfalls. </p><p>Continue to Niagara Falls to explore the American Falls and ride the Maid of the Mist boat (in season, or go behind the falls otherwise), and spend the night.</p><p>The next day, view Horseshoe Falls, explore Niagara-on-the-Lake, and head to Toronto, for a guided tour of the city's highlights. Spend the night in Niagara Falls or Thousand Islands area, depending on the season.</p><p>On the last day, enjoy a boat cruise around the Thousand Islands, then head back to New York City, stopping at the Delaware Water Gap and outlet shops in Poconos along the way.</p><p>Your tour ends with drop-off back in New York City.</p></div>",
