      "name": "Panoramic Guided Tour in Brooklyn Heights and Hamilton Park",
      "description": "<div><p>Join our amazing NYC evening sightseeing tour to appreciate the thousand lights of the Big Apple at night. This tour is designed to take your breath away and allow you to take some unforgettable photos.</p><p>The evening tour starts at 18.30 with your Urban Explorer with which you will cross Manhattan until you arrive in one of the most famous viewpoints in New York: Brooklyn Heights. After taking incredible photos of the Manhattan night view while walking along the promenade and admiring the Brooklyn Bridge, you will continue to New Jersey where we will stop for a short stop to enjoy a slice of American \"cheese\" pizza in Hoboken. Next we will arrive at the famous Hamilton Park, the highest point in New Jersey, for an unforgettable view among the thousand lights of New York!</p></div>",
