      "name": "The best of New York City walking tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Feel the unique energy of New York together with a professional guide. The tour is designed for those who want to save time. Experience the most in a short time.</p><p>One of the most diverse cities on the planet speaks more than 800 languages! It is a mix of different cultures, art, impressive buildings, and food. Is it true that English muffins, eggs benedict, and even ice cream cones are from New York City? Surprises are in every corner. Honking cars’ horn here is illegal. But going topless- not! You will have the chance to feed pigeons in one of the most filmed locations in the world- Central Park. You will try whispering in Grand Central Terminal and will find out why it is a “thing”. You will see Empire State Building, and will hear why lightning hits it ~25 times per year! You will be amazed by the lights of Times Square. It is so brightly lit, that can be seen from outer space!</p></div>",
