      "name": "Half Day Guided Tour to Gospel Magic and Harlem",
      "description": "<div><p>Let yourself be enchanted by the Harlem Tour and its magic thanks to our Urban Explorer that will make you experience the essence of African American culture. It will be a spiritual journey that will take you to visit the churches until you experience the most mystical experience that Harlem can offer: the Gospel Mass. What was once considered simply \"the black neighborhood\" is now a \"melting pot\" of different cultures, each with its own characteristics, capable of enhancing the most beautiful places in the area. You will be amazed at the sight of Saint John the Divine, the largest neo-Gothic church in the world. In addition, you can visit the Apollo Theater from the outside, where Michael Jackson's star began to shine, Sylvia's restaurant, famous for its \"soul\" cuisine, up to the church where you can attend a gospel mass. Return to the starting point at 13.00. Attention: you must wear a mask to attend mass.</p></div>",
