      "name": "Times Square Doughnut Walking Foor Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Begin your day on a sweet note with a guided doughnut tour of Times Square and the surrounding area. Follow your local expert to several top-rated doughnut shops—some traditional, others delightfully creative—and sample a variety of flavors and styles. Along the way, learn insider tips on the city’s evolving pastry scene, hear fun trivia about doughnut culture in NYC, and get recommendations for more sweet spots to visit on your own. It’s a playful, sugar-coated look at Times Square that will leave your taste buds happy.</p></div>",
