      "name": "Central Park Pedicab Tour – Guided Ride with Stops",
      "description": "<div><p>Ride Through Movie Scenes, Music History &amp; NYC Magic — All from the Comfort of Your Pedicab</p><p>Discover Central Park like never before on a relaxing and fun pedicab tour with a local guide! Sit back as we pedal you through iconic locations you've seen in movies, TV shows, and music history.</p><p>We’ll stop at the beautiful Bethesda Fountain, where street performers often play under the arches. You’ll visit the Friends Fountain for a fun photo moment, glide over the Home Alone 2 bridge (Gapstow Bridge), and pause at the peaceful Strawberry Fields John Lennon Memorial.</p><p>Along the way, your guide will share fun facts, take your pictures, and give you time to explore each location — no walking required!</p><p>Whether you're a couple looking for a romantic ride, a family with kids, or just want to see NYC from a new angle, this tour is the perfect way to enjoy Central Park in comfort and style.</p></div>",
