      "name": "Walking Tour of NYC and Yankees Game",
      "description": "<div><p>If you like sports and want to discover New York in a different way, join us for an unforgettable adventure! We'll be in the city center to head to the iconic Holcombe Rucker Park, located in the heart of Harlem (transportation not included, ticket $2.90).This legendary basketball court is not only famous for its incredible history, but also for being a cradle of basketball talent. Rucker Park has hosted countless streetball games and tournaments, where basketball legends like Kobe Bryant showed off their skills.</p><p>Then we will take the train again and go to the Bronx, where we will see the famous Joker Stairs, already converted into a place of worship for movie lovers. From there, we will continue to Yankee Stadium to watch a live Yankees game (ticket included), where we will talk about the game, anecdotes, baseball history and many more things. Don’t miss this unique and unrepeatable experience!</p></div>",
