      "name": "Williamsburg Best of Brooklyn Guided Walking Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Join your guide on the streets of Williamsburg and get ready to explore one of Brooklyn’s most popular neighborhoods. Check out chic boutiques, hip cafes, and colorful street art as you explore the local scene.</p><p>Learn how the borough started as a hub for immigration and later became known for its skilled factory workers. Get a deeper understanding of Brooklyn’s transformation and get the scoop on the Mysterious Staring Artist and the Billion Dollar Sugar Scheme. </p><p>Get an inside look at the iconic architecture, restored artists lofts, massive murals, and one-of-a-kind boutiques, while getting insider tips on the neighborhood’s best restaurants, bars, and cafes. Finish with spectacular city views of the Manhattan Skyline from across the East River State Park before heading back to the starting point of the tour.</p></div>",
