      "description": "<div><p>Take flight from the Manhattan Heliport and embark on an exhilarating helicopter journey over New York City. Throughout this narrated flight, enjoy modern and historical insights from your pilot while witnessing the city’s most famous sights from a unique vantage point. Marvel at landmarks including:</p><p>• <strong>Statue of Liberty</strong>\n\n• <strong>Ellis Island</strong>\n\n• <strong>One World Trade Center</strong>\n\n• <strong>Chrysler Building</strong>\n\n• <strong>Empire State Building</strong>\n\n• <strong>Chelsea Piers</strong>\n\n• <strong>Times Square</strong>\n\n• <strong>Intrepid Sea, Air &amp; Space Museum</strong>\n\n• <strong>Central Park</strong>\n\n• <strong>Columbia University</strong>\n\n• <strong>Grant’s Tomb</strong>\n\n• <strong>Yankee Stadium</strong> (excluding game days)\n\n• <strong>The Palisades</strong>\n\n• <strong>George Washington Bridge</strong>\n\n• <strong>Northern Tip of Manhattan</strong>\n\n• <strong>Verrazzano-Narrows Bridge</strong>\n\n• <strong>Brooklyn</strong></p><p>This unparalleled experience offers panoramic views of the city that never sleeps, ensuring you leave with lasting memories of NYC’s skyline from above.</p></div>",
