      "name": "West Chelsea Curated Art Gallery Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Just under the High Line and just north of the Meatpacking District, Manhattan's historic West Chelsea arts district has been a major art-world hot-spot for decades, featuring some of the world's most important art galleries. But, where to start? This tour takes visitors to a curated selection of six galleries, highlighting some of the best contemporary art on view in the city. For each exhibit, I provide information and context, and facilitate a brief, casual discussion about the art. People who have taken the tour tell me it's a great, accessible way to learn about art.</p></div>",
