      "name": "Guided Walking Tour Of Central Park",
      "description": "<div><p>Get to the root of Central Park with our 2-hour walking tour. Explore the most famous park in the world with this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. Few will get to see how the twists and turns of Central Park unfold to reveal the essence of the park. See the green, beating heart amid the hustle and bustle of New York City. Hear the distinct crunch of Central Park dirt beneath your feet as you enjoy your holiday adventure. Feel the warm shafts of light as the sun’s gaze rests on your face. Then the swift breeze will call you back to how fleeting life really is. Your seasoned tour guide will be with you every step of the way on this emotional, physical, and spiritual journey to bestow on you the rich history of these incredible sights. </p><p> Your desire for knowledge will finally be satiated by our comprehensive tour. Count yourself among the lucky few when you finally learn what makes Central Park so special.</p><p>Tours can be given in any language at no additional charge with advance notice.</p></div>",
