      "name": "NYC Evening Cruise Golden Hour with Breathtaking Views",
      "description": "<div><p>Experience New York City at its Most Magical Hour</p><p>Set sail into the heart of the city at golden hour on the NYC Evening Cruise: Golden Hour with Breathtaking Views a scenic and relaxing journey through New York Harbor during the most stunning time of day.</p><p>As the sun begins to set, watch the city transform under warm, glowing skies. From the comfort of a spacious sightseeing vessel, enjoy unmatched views of New York’s most iconic landmarks, including the Statue of Liberty, Ellis Island, the Brooklyn, Manhattan Bridges, and the majestic Manhattan skyline.</p><p>Whether you're traveling with family, friends, or that special someone, this early evening cruise offers the perfect mix of sightseeing, fresh air, and unforgettable memories. With both open-air upper decks and climate-controlled indoor seating, everyone can enjoy the ride in comfort.</p><p>See NYC from the water as it sparkles into the night. The golden hour cruise offers beauty, peace, and unforgettable views you won’t find on land.</p></div>",
