      "name": "East Village Ice Cream Crawl",
      "description": "<div><p>* All ice cream included *</p><p>Toasted Sesame Nutella. Salty Caramel. Foxy Brown. Cereal Milk. Peppermint Chocolate. Brooklyn Brown Sugar Chunk. Thai Iced Tea. Earl Gray Tea. Oreo Cookie Dough. Cake Batter. Ginger. Honey Comb.</p><p>We stop at five different world-class New York City ice cream shops on this 1.5 mile 1.5 hour tour.</p><p>While exploring the East Village we hit the best ice cream shops and taste no fewer than 12 flavors based on a mix of my experience and your interest.</p><p>You will get the chance to experience a unique and authentic cooking class/food tour/dinner with a local host, hand selected by Eatwith, the world’s largest community for authentic culinary experiences. Eatwith experiences are top rated on TripAdvisor and are loved by thousands of travelers from around the world!</p></div>",
