      "name": "The Incredible Brooklyn Bridge & Manhattan Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>This 3 hour tour lets you see and experience the big attractions in NYC. Brooklyn Bridge &amp; Lower Manhattan</p><p>We start in Brooklyn at the foot of the world famous Brooklyn Bridge at York Street Metro Station</p><p>Get a great photo of the Manhattan Bridge from Dumbo. Then we head to Brooklyn Bridge Park under the Brooklyn Bridge. See civil war era Warehouses that have been turned into restaurants</p><p>We head to Brooklyn heights and the promenade (You will be familiar with the views from this area from many famous movies / TV Shows)</p><p>After our quick tour of Brooklyn, we start our walk across the Brooklyn Bridge. This is where we will see the best views of the Manhattan skyline. Lots of photo opportunities here and its one of the best experiences in Manhattan</p><p>Once we have crossed over the bridge we head into Lower Manhattan. You will see a lot in this area. China Town, Little Italy, 5 points, 9/11 memorial, Ground Zero, Woolworth Building, City Hall, Wall St &amp; The NY Stock Exchange</p></div>",
