      "description": "<div><p>Begin with evening pickup directly from your hotel, and travel with your private guide to Brooklyn. Then, kick off your nighttime walking tour in the elegant Brooklyn Heights neighborhood.</p><p>Explore the best of this upscale area, which offers sweeping views of the New York City skyline from across the water. Pass by historic brownstones and stately mansions while learning insider facts and stories.</p><p>Proceed next to the adjacent DUMBO neighborhood, an area known for its ex-industrial heritage. After getting a look at the now-hip residential and commercial district, you’ll ascend to the iconic Brooklyn Bridge for a walk into Manhattan. </p><p>Feel the energy of nighttime New York and the wind off the harbor as you walk towards the illuminated Manhattan skyline. Upon arrival, set off to explore a range of Lower Manhattan highlights. You'll see Wall Street landmarks like the Charging Bull and Trinity Church, and admire New York City Hall. </p><p>After strolling down the iconic Broadway, finish your tour in Battery Park, which offers picture-perfect views of the New York Harbor.</p></div>",
