      "name": "Private NYC Luxury Lounge in Central Park",
      "description": "<div><p>Hustling, bustling NYC now offers quaint quietness in open air lounging in the most famous green space: Central Park.</p><p>Stop and smell (and lounge in) the roses. Bask in the fresh park air on comfy cushions, blankets, and billowy pillows.</p><p>WHAT MAKES THIS SUCH A UNIQUELY NYC THING TO DO: So many in their travel pre-planning do not always factor in relaxing, comfy lounging in iconic Central Park, OR those that plan it usually have to purchase their own items such as picnic blanket, snacks, water bottles, etc. This becomes cumbersome for visitors and locals. We make it easy for our customers so it is hassle free, fuss free.</p><p>*INCLUDES: yummy snacks, bottled water, games&amp;activities, relaxation recommendations, sunscreen, bug spray, bug candles, etc. Additional self-care items for purchase.</p><p>And never feel rushed out of relaxing, open air luxuriating self care! Your day is covered from 11am to near dinnertime/nightfall! (seasonal daily end times).</p><p>Lavatories, water fountains nearby.</p></div>",
