      "name": "New York City: Central Park Private Flexible Bike Rental",
      "description": "<div><p>This sprawling green oasis in the middle of the city’s urban bustle covers 843 acres (341 hectares) traversed by numerous paved paths, making it a perfect destination to explore by bike. </p><p>Due to Central Park’s popularity, bike rentals often sell out during peak season, so pre-book your rental to ensure there will be a bike waiting for you.</p><p>Upon arrival, pick up your bike, helmet, lock, and bike bag at the rental shop, located just blocks away from the park. Rent a bike for just an hour or up to 24 hours, depending on your schedule.</p><p>With the help of a free park map and the recommendations of rental staff, set off to explore more than 47 miles (75 km) of bike-friendly paths that wind through open meadows, lakes, bridges, gardens, and memorials. </p><p>See famous attractions such as the Conservatory Garden, Belvedere Castle, the Central Park Zoo, the Imagine Mosaic, and the Central Park Carousel. Enjoy the flexibility of touring on two wheels, and stop to admire the scenery or take a rest as often as you like.</p><p>At the end of the rental period, return your bike to the facility.</p></div>",
