      "name": "New York City Sensi Stone Mystery Self Guided Family Quest",
      "description": "<div><p>New York City has lost its senses—literally! The sky is gray, the streets are silent, and even the bakeries smell like... nothing. The magical Sensi-Stone has gone missing, and it’s up to Kid Quest and their quirky crew to bring it back.</p><p>Using your smartphone, follow interactive clues and solve 10–15 clever puzzles as you walk past iconic sights and hidden corners. With each riddle cracked, you’ll uncover pieces of a playful story designed for kids and curious minds alike. It’s a whimsical mission full of teamwork, imagination, and real-world discovery.</p><p>What makes this tour unique? It transforms New York into a living storybook where you and your group become the heroes of a sensory-saving adventure—perfect for families, first-time visitors, or anyone looking for an unexpected way to explore the city.</p><p>Play at your own pace, pause anytime, and enjoy a flexible, screen-guided adventure made for families, friends, and solo explorers.</p></div>",
