      "name": "Central Park TV and Movie Sites Walking Tour (On Location Tours)",
      "description": "<div><p>Meet your private guide in Central Park and set off to discover the park’s cinematic legacy, stopping at more than 30 recognizable filming locations. From the Wollman Rink featured in <em>Serendipity</em> to the Carousel, Bow Bridge, Naumburg Bandshell, and Strawberry Fields, learn about memorable scenes shot here for classics like <em>Breakfast at Tiffany’s</em>, <em>Ghostbusters</em>, <em>When Harry Met Sally</em>, <em>The Avengers</em>, and even <em>Sex and the City</em>. Along the way, hear behind-the-scenes stories, snap pictures at each iconic spot, and get a new appreciation for Central Park’s unique role in Hollywood history.</p></div>",
