      "name": "SoHo, Little Italy, and Chinatown Walking Tour in New York",
      "description": "<div><p>Discover the eclectic character of three classic Manhattan neighborhoods—SoHo, Little Italy, and Chinatown—on this immersive, two-hour walking tour. Led by an expert local guide, you’ll stroll the cobblestone streets of SoHo to admire 19th-century cast-iron architecture, learn about early immigrant struggles in Little Italy (including traces of mob history), and take in the vibrant sights and scents of Chinatown. Sample authentic cuisines and treats along the way as you encounter the stories and cultures that shaped these lively communities into the iconic destinations they are today.</p></div>",
