      "description": "<div><p>Your flight over Manhattan begins at your preferred time; numerous departure slots are available throughout the day, so you can pick the one that fits your busy sightseeing schedule best. </p><p>Make your own way to the Downtown Manhattan Heliport, meet your pilot, and hop aboard. With a maximum of only five other passengers, this shared flight offers a much more affordable option than a private flight, while still providing a personalized experience.</p><p>Then, without delay, take to the skies. Enjoy a comfortable ride in the climate-controlled cabin, while floor-to-ceiling windows offer the best possible viewing experience. Fly over the Big Apple and see a perspective on the city that few others get to experience. As you soar over landmarks like the Statue of Liberty, Empire State Building, and Brooklyn Bridge, learn more from your pilot’s on-board commentary. </p><p>Your flight will last 12-15 minutes: enough time to see the best of the city. Your experience ends after touching down at your original departure point.</p></div>",
