      "name": "NYC: Brooklyn Heights, DUMBO Small-Group or Private Food Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>Immerse yourself in Brooklyn's eclectic, delectable food culture on this small-group or private walking tour. Start your tour in Brooklyn Heights, a history-saturated neighborhood that offers a diverse patchwork of old brownstones, historic Italian eateries, and Middle Eastern food markets for you to discover.</p><p>Next, continue to the Brooklyn Bridge for some of the most impressive views of the Manhattan skyline before continuing your food-themed adventure at a popular street food market.</p><p>Your tour continues in the nearby DUMBO neighborhood, known for its cool art scene and even cooler food stops. Enjoy a wide range of samples as you continue to soak up the borough's unique history.</p><p>Your tour finishes right by the Fulton Ferry Landing, right on the waterfront.</p></div>",
