      "description": "<div><p>Discover more than four centuries of life and death in Manhattan with a tour (based on the book Death in New York and led by author K. Krombie) of Battery Park, the Financial District, Tribeca, the Civic Center, and Chinatown.</p><p>Main Features:</p><p>Find out about New York City’s indigenous Lenape burial sites.</p><p>Discover the quarrels of New Amsterdam over burial space and new arrivals.</p><p>Learn about the British prisons for American Patriots during the Revolutionary War.</p><p>Hear about Manhattan’s riots, epidemics, and crucial changes in legislation.</p><p>Peer at the islands of New York Harbor, forgotten burial grounds, a Manhattan jail, and a busy funeral industry street.</p></div>",
