      "name": "Central Park, Rockefeller & Times Square Horse Carriage Ride",
      "description": "<div><p>Begin your journey at the corner of 59th Street and 6th Avenue, where a horse-drawn carriage is ready to guide you through some of Manhattan’s most iconic sights. A brief wander into Central Park reveals its calm pathways and scenic nooks—an unexpected pocket of tranquility amidst the city hustle. Traveling onward to Fifth Avenue, you’ll pass renowned landmarks, including the famed Apple store, before venturing into the Rockefeller area, brimming with history and architectural grandeur. Finally, continue into the electrifying glow of Times Square, watching visitors from across the globe gather under the vibrant neon lights. From the cozy seat of your carriage, it’s as if you’re witnessing a stage show of New York’s diverse energy—a delightful blend of timeless tradition and modern spectacle.</p></div>",
