      "name": "New York Red Bulls Football Game Ticket at Red Bull Arena",
      "description": "<div><p>A footballing oasis found deep inside the concrete jungle, Red Bull Arena offers one of the best atmospheres in the MLS. The New York Red Bulls fans always bring the energy, flying high from minute one to ninety, their unrivalled passion creates an atmosphere akin to those in Europe. For the ultimate MLS experience, look no further than Red Bull Arena!</p><p>A storied MLS franchise the Red Bulls have been blessed with legends of the game such as Thierry Henry and Tim Cahill in their recent history. With a number of high-stakes rivalries throughout the North East region, big-time games at Red Bull Arena are frequent.</p><p>Championing one of the most productive academy structures in the MLS, the Red Bulls emphasise promoting local talent. The club is ingrained into the local community, offering an authentic and unique perspective of the local New Jersey and New York Metro region. Whether you're a soccer fanatic or a casual fan, a trip to Red Bull Arena is an experience not to be missed!</p></div>",
