      "name": "Toronto Blue Jays Baseball Game Tickets at Rogers Center",
      "description": "<div><p>The Blue Jays are more than just Canada's team, they're MLB's international outpost. With a fanbase that stretches coast-to-coast, the Blue Jays unite a nation. That Canadian pride brings a uniquely spirited, multicultural energy to Rogers Centre that you won't find anywhere else in the league.Rogers Centre was a marvel when it opened, boasting the first fully retractable roof in MLB, and it's undergone major renovations to bring it into a new era. The recent upgrades have transformed the fan experience with social viewing decks, revamped outfield districts, and incredible views from wherever you are in the park.The Blue Jays field one of the most exciting young cores in the game, led by the sons of legends, Vladimir Guerrero Jr. and Bo Bichette, who bring talent, charisma, and highlight-reel moments every night. Combine that on-field electricity with a crowd that's fiercely loyal and proud to represent an entire nation, and you've got a game-day experience like no other!</p></div>",
