      "name": "Niagara Falls: Day Trip from Toronto with Hotel Transfer",
      "description": "<div><p>This dynamic day trip showcases the finest of Niagara Falls and the Niagara Peninsula, including Niagara-on-the-Lake, hailed as Ontario's most enchanting town.\r</p><p>The itinerary is a wanderer's fantasy brought to life. It offers a generous three hours to revel in the awe-inspiring vista of the Falls. Opt for the Hornblower Niagara Cruise and embrace the tingling sensation of the mist on your skin.\r</p><p>Next, the tour whisks you off to the charming hamlet of Niagara-on-the-Lake. Spend a delightful hour strolling its charming avenues and capturing memorable snapshots.\r</p><p>Also included in the tour is a visit to a local winery and a tasting of ice wines. The day culminates with a picturesque voyage back to Toronto.</p></div>",
