      "description": "<div><p>Make your way to the meeting point or request pickup (select downtown Toronto hotels only). Board the air-conditioned bus and settle in for the journey.</p><p>Stop for a wine tasting at one of Niagara-on-the-Lake's best wineries. Then, continue to Niagara Falls to enjoy a 3-course lunch at a restaurant overlooking the falls. </p><p>At the Table Rock Welcome Centre, make use of your free time to go up close and feel the mist of the falls and take pictures.</p><p>In the summer, you'll go on a Niagara City Cruises boat tour, which provides stunning views of the Niagara Gorge, American Falls, Bridal Veil Falls, and Canadian Horseshoe Falls. The alternative winter experience is Journey Behind the Falls, which offers unique views of the falls. </p><p>Discover the old-world charm of Niagara-on-the-Lake and use your free time to explore historic sites and boutique shops.</p><p>Upon your return to Toronto, you will be dropped off where you were originally picked up.</p></div>",
