      "shortDescription": "Haunted theatres, unsolved mysteries, and Toronto's terrifying history",
      "description": "You'll never look at Toronto the same way again after this spine-tingling tour!\r\n\r\nMeet your cloaked guide at the Hockey Hall of Fame, where a restless spirit with a broken heart resides. Your guide will lead you through the streets by lantern-light, sharing dark tales from Toronto's early days, and its most famous paranormal encounters.\r\n\r\nEnd your evening outside one of the city's most haunted locations: Mackenzie House. Be warned – its unsettling story might just keep you up at night!",
