      "name": "Chicago full-day bike rental",
      "description": "<div><p>Head on a biking adventure on America's number 1 city for biking. Not only is Chicago is geographically flat which makes it a perfect city for cycling, it it home to the famous Chicago's Lakefront Trail. Follow the path past lively neighborhoods, green parks, and beautiful beaches. Take a break in a local cafe such as Old Town or Lincoln Park or get some ethnic food in Chinatown.Pick-up your bike from the shop located in the middle of Chicago's Lakefront Bike Path. Complete with a lock, helmet, and bike map you are safe to go on your biking adventure. Make your own way on the bike path or follow one of the routes from the bike map if you want to get away from the touristy paths and explore some upscale neighborhoods. Along the bike path, you will pass parks and beaches to take a little break, lively local neighborhoods to explore and so much more!If you are traveling with children you can follow the trail to the kid-friendly Lincoln Park Free Zoo, Maggie Daley Children’s Free Park, and the Chicago Children’s Museum, all a short ride from the starting point. There is something to do for everyone!</p></div>",
