      "name": "Chicago: 75 Minute Architecture River Cruise From Michigan Avenue",
      "description": "<div><p>Set sail from Michigan Avenue and treat yourself to America's most popular river cruise! Cruise merrily down the Chicago River, and soak up some spectacular views of the Windy City's world-famous skyline.\r</p><p>There's no better place to admire Chicago's stunning architecture than from the water, and your expert guide will stuff your brain with trivia, facts, and fun.\r</p><p>Chicago's epic skyline is a melting pot of eclectic designs and gigantic skyscrapers. Now's your chance to get up close and personal with some of the world's greatest buildings, on this award-winning cruise. \r</p><p>Departing from Michigan Avenue, your comfortable ship will take you on a whirlwind tour of over 40 Chicagoan landmarks, including the Tribune Tower, Wrigley Building, Marina City, and more.\r</p><p>All you have to do is sit back, soak in the sights, and enjoy the educational facts and stories of your charming guide.</p></div>",
