      "name": "360 Chicago Observation Deck Tickets",
      "description": "<div><p>360 CHICAGO’s concourse level includes an interactive exhibit highlighting the history of Chicago and the vibrant cultures and businesses across Chicago neighbourhoods. Get inspired to explore Chicago, and it's 77 neighbourhoods, as you navigate City of Neighborhoods and City the Beautiful.Travel to the 94th floor in 40-seconds on one of North America’s fastest lifts and step foot onto the observation deck to experience what '\"Travel &amp; Leisure Magazine\" voted one of the best views in America.Experience 360 CHICAGO Observation Deck with panoramic views of the city, lakefront, and four neighbouring states, you can download the Magnicity App for a guided tour right from your smartphone. The app includes unique facts, stories, and recommendations to further enjoy Chicago.TILT offers thrill-seekers the chance to see Chicago from a one-of-a-kind view. Step onto TILT and peer out of the building through floor to ceiling windows at a 30-degree angle, 1,000 feet above Michigan Ave. Finally, the CloudBar serves up iconic Chicago snacks, like Garrett’s popcorn, and neighbourhood-inspired cocktails and local breweries.General Entry Ticket: Allows you to skip the ticket desk and head directly to the security check pointFast Pass Ticket: Allows you an expedited entry to the Observation Deck</p></div>",
