      "name": "Guided Excursion to Quebec City from Montreal with a Cruise on the St. Lawrence River",
      "shortDescription": "Are you based in Montreal and want to discover Quebec City for a day? Then this sightseeing tour is for you!",
      "description": "<p>Are you based in Montreal and want to discover Quebec City for a day? Then this sightseeing tour is for you!</p>\n<p>If you don't have a car and want to visit Quebec City from Montreal, this day tour is the experience you don't want to miss! Accompanied by a guide who will introduce you to the city, you will discover its must-see sites on foot but also by boat on an afternoon cruise on the St. Lawrence River.</p>\n<p>Your excursion to Quebec City from Montreal will begin with a 1-hour walking tour of the famous Montmorency Falls, a must-see on any visit to Quebec City. You will then take the bus to the city centre for 3 hours of free time in Old Quebec and the Petit Champlain district where you can have lunch (not included in the price), stroll around and do as much shopping as you like.</p>\n<p>Finally, at 2 or 4 p.m. depending on your choice, you will embark on the last leg of your Quebec City sightseeing tour, a guided cruise on the St. Lawrence River! For 1.5 hours, you will have the pleasure of admiring the Ch&acirc;teau Frontenac towering over Old Quebec, the Montmorency Falls from a different angle to the morning, and the &Icirc;le d'Orl&eacute;ans, all while enjoying the guide's informative commentary.</p>\n<p>Packed with discoveries, this guided tour of Quebec City is not to be missed under any circumstances if you want to visit Quebec City from Montreal!</p>",
