      "description": "<div><p>Step aboard for a family-friendly brunch cruise on the St. Lawrence River. Savour a delicious 3-course meal prepared onboard as you sail past Montréal's iconic sites.Enjoy brunch during the first hour, followed by a scenic 90-minute guided cruise offering unforgettable views of the city. Admire the cityscape from the glass-enclosed dining rooms and outside terraces, and experience the perfect cruise with your loved ones.Upgrade to the VIP Signature option for an even more exceptional experience! Skip the line with priority boarding, enjoy a mimosa upon arrival (non-alcoholic option available), and sit by the window to take in breathtaking views. The ultimate experience awaits!The brunch menu (subject to seasonal changes - crafted with local ingredients) includes a fresh selection of pastries and a yogurt parfait with wild blueberries, oats and white chocolate, followed by 2 main course options:a gourmet option like a savoury casserole, a traditional Québecois plate, golden waffles with maple cream, a local cheese omelettea hearty vegan option including potatoes with salted herbs, bacon, and vegan sausagesKids can enjoy potatoes, bacon, and fruit. The brunch ends with a duo of profiteroles and homemade chocolate sauce. Drinks included are coffee, tea, and orange juice. After brunch, head outdoors to learn about Québec's rich heritage from a bilingual guide.</p></div>",
