      "description": "<div><p>Take our Private Walking Tour of Old Montreal! See the historical sights of Old Montreal, a.k.a. Vieux-Montréal, on an immersive, private walking tour. Following a private guide, you'll learn about the city's history, which dates back to 1642, as you visit attractions such as Notre-Dame-de-Bon-Secours Chapel, Place d'Armes, and the Old Port of Montreal. Free of big tour groups and with ample chance to ask questions, you'll enjoy a more personalized way to see the city's best. Leave us the details and we will take you on an extraordinary adventure that will create memories that will stand the test of time!</p></div>",
