      "name": "Discover Vietnamese Buddhist Cuisine around Montreal Jean-Talon",
      "description": "<div><p>Do you think Vietnamese food is only bánh mì and phở? Are you a practicing vegetarian/vegan and want to explore Vietnamese végé cuisine? Or a meat-eater curious about how végé food can replicate meat?</p><p>Then discover Vietnamese Buddhist cuisine! </p><p>During this small-group tour, I'll enlighten you about Vietnamese vegetarian food while we feast to help out a Buddhist nonprofit and other Vietnamese small businesses.</p><p>This tour is customizable to vegan diets, to avoid allergies, different days/times, group sizes, etc. </p><p>Please be on the lookout for a message with further information after booking.</p></div>",
