      "description": "<div><p>One of the “original six” Watching the Montreal Canadiens live is an unparalleled experience that immerses you in the heart of hockey tradition. “Les Habitants” are not just a team—they are a symbol of pride for the city and the entire province of Quebec. Bell Centre, one of the most iconic arenas in the NHL, offers an electrifying atmosphere, where every game feels like a historic event.</p><p>The Canadiens are synonymous with success, with a record 24 Stanley Cups to their name, making them the most successful team in NHL history. While they are currently in the midst of a rebuilding phase, the team remain ultra competitive, promising edge of the seat hockey at every occasion.</p><p>Montreal is a hockey mecca, and a Canadiens game feels like a shared experience where every fan is part of the team’s legacy. Ingrained into the city's bilingual community, embracing both English and French Canadian traditions, a visit to a Canadiens game offers an authentically amazing perspective of Montreal!</p></div>",
