      "name": "SKY Heli Tour of Vancouver (Vancouver Departure)",
      "description": "<div><p>This is the ultimate sightseeing experience - an unparalleled, bird’s-eye view of one of the most stunning cities in the world. Departing directly from downtown Vancouver’s heliport, right next to the world-famous cruise terminal, you’ll soar over iconic landmarks and breathtaking landscapes. Glide across the sparkling waters of Burrard Inlet, flying high above the vibrant cityscape, with the towering peaks of the Coast Mountain Range right at your fingertips. From the lush expanse of Stanley Park to the awe-inspiring Lions Gate Bridge, you’ll see Vancouver like never before. And don’t forget the cruise ships—get so close you can practically wave to the passengers sipping cocktails on deck! </p><p>When weather permits, we orbit right inside a crater of a dormant volcano. Truly an out of this world experience!</p></div>",
