      "name": "Vancouver City and Seals Scenic Boat Tour by Vancouver Water Adventures",
      "description": "<div><p>Get to know the beautiful city of Vancouver, British Columbia, from the water on this guided, sightseeing boat tour. </p><p>The tour begins from the shopping district of Granville Island and proceeds out to Vancouver Harbour. Travel along the coastline of English Bay, out to Lighthouse Park, over to the Seal Colony and eventually into False Creek in the heart of the city. </p><p>Along the way, learn about Vancouver’s history and hear the stories that made this bustling west coast seaport what it is today. </p><p>Also, see Stanley Park, the Lions Gate Bridge, Siwash Rock, Jericho Sailing Centre, popular Kitsilano Beach, Science World at Telus World of Science, Yaletown, plus offshore freighters, the beautiful homes of West Vancouver and much more.</p></div>",
