      "name": "Scenic Seaplane Flight: Vancouver to Powell River (One Way)",
      "description": "<div><p>Experience the perfect blend of efficiency, comfort, and breathtaking views with Harbour Air's direct flights between Vancouver and Powell River. Enjoy stunning views of the Northern Sunshine Coast, Powell Lake, and surrounding islands.</p><p>Harbour Air makes it easy to travel between Powell River and downtown Vancouver. Our flights land at the Harbour Flight Centre, next to Canada Place. In Powell River, we land directly on Powell Lake at the Shingle Mill Pub, offering easy access to attractions.</p><p>Powell River is the gateway to the Northern Sunshine Coast, with access to destinations like Lund, Saltery Bay, and the Discovery Islands. Whether hiking, exploring coastal towns, or relaxing, Powell River offers endless outdoor opportunities.</p><p>With Harbour Air, your journey is part of the adventure. From fast, efficient travel to unforgettable views and eco-friendly service, we offer the best way to travel between Vancouver and Powell River. Book your flight today and experience travel</p></div>",
