      "description": "<div><p>Explore one of Canada’s most beautiful cities on this full-day tour of Victoria and Butchart Gardens. Your excursion begins with morning pickup from your hotel (alternatively ,make your own way to the departure point), followed by a scenic ferry ride through the Gulf Islands. </p><p>Dock on Vancouver Island with the whole day ahead of you. Hop aboard the awaiting coach, and get a lay of the land as you travel to Victoria. Then enjoy leisure time to grab some lunch (own expense) and visit landmarks like the Royal BC Museum, Parliament Buildings, Fairmont Empress Hotel, and Chinatown.</p><p>Saving the best for last, your Victoria tour concludes with a visit to Butchart Gardens. Stroll along flower-lined paths, discover the many themed gardens, and admire the remarkable landscaping.</p><p>After your garden tour, head to the ferry for the relaxing ride back to Vancouver. Your tour ends with return service to your departure point. </p></div>",
