      "name": "Private Vancouver City Highlights 2 Hour Walking Tour",
      "description": "<div><p>This 2-hour Private Walking Tour of Vancouver will connect you with the highlights of the city through the eyes of a local guide.</p><p>Together we will walk the most exciting and historic areas of Vancouver, learning about the city and the province, and how they fit into Canada. We will meet local legends and discover the many notable establishments along the way. The tour is filled with recommendations &amp; tips to ensure you get the most out of your trip to the city!</p><p>Your local Toonie Tour guide will make Vancouver’s rich history come alive, introducing you to iconic and picture-ready sites like the Marine Building, the Gastown Steam Clock, Waterfront Station, Vancouver Harbor, and many more. You’ll learn about Vancouver’s rich and impressive history as a First Nation Village and discover Canada’s humble beginnings as a resource-rich settlement that became a country among nations.</p><p>This tour is best for those who have limited time in the city and want to make the most of it!</p></div>",
